window.ACP_Q=[{"id":"520.1.1-e01","sec":"520.1.1","dom":"520.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A company wants to use Atlassian Guard to manage its employees' Atlassian accounts. It uses Trello and Bitbucket but has no Jira or Confluence. How should the admin create an Atlassian organization?","zh":"一家公司想用 Atlassian Guard 管理員工的 Atlassian 帳號。它使用 Trello 與 Bitbucket，但沒有 Jira 或 Confluence。Admin 應該怎麼建立 Atlassian organization？","zo":["請 Atlassian support 把 Trello workspace 轉成 organization","到 admin.atlassian.com/o/create 建立沒有 app 的 organization","先註冊一個免費 Jira 站台，建立 organization 後再移除 Jira"],"fig":"","opts":["Ask Atlassian support to convert the Trello workspace into an organization","Create an organization without apps at admin.atlassian.com/o/create","Sign up for a free Jira site, then remove Jira after the organization is created"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。官方沒有「把 Trello workspace 轉成 organization」的作法；建立 organization 是自助操作，不需要找 support。","B":"對。官方提供「不含 app 的 organization」：到 admin.atlassian.com/o/create 輸入名稱建立，系統會引導開始 Atlassian Guard Standard 的 30 天試用，之後就能驗證網域、管理帳號。","C":"錯。註冊 Jira 確實會同時建立 site 與 organization，但會多出一個用不到的 app；官方已經有不需要 app 就能建立 organization 的方式。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/get-started-with-an-atlassian-organization/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.1.1-e02","sec":"520.1.1","dom":"520.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An admin signs up for Jira for the first time from www.atlassian.com and enters 'acme-dev' as the site name. What is created?","zh":"Admin 第一次從 www.atlassian.com 註冊 Jira，site 名稱輸入「acme-dev」。會建立什麼？","zo":["只有 Jira app；admin 要另外建立 organization 才能邀請使用者","acme-dev.atlassian.net 這個 site，並加入由 Atlassian 管理的共用 organization","acme-dev.atlassian.net 這個 site 與一個新的 organization，admin 是 org admin"],"fig":"","opts":["Only the Jira app; the admin must create an organization separately before inviting users","A site at acme-dev.atlassian.net that joins a shared organization managed by Atlassian","A site at acme-dev.atlassian.net and a new organization, with the admin as organization admin"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。註冊 app 的流程本身就會建立 organization，完成後可以直接到 Atlassian Administration 邀請使用者，不必另外建立。","B":"錯。沒有「Atlassian 共用的 organization」；每次這樣註冊都會建立屬於你自己的 organization，由你擔任 org admin。","C":"對。第一次註冊 app 時會同時建立 site 與 organization；輸入的 site 名稱就是網址的子網域。建立 organization 的人自動成為 org admin。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/get-started-with-an-atlassian-organization/","https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/what-are-the-different-types-of-admin-roles/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.1.1-e03","sec":"520.1.1","dom":"520.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Which user management experience does this organization use?","zh":"請看圖。這個 organization 使用哪一種 user management 體驗？","zo":["Centralized，因為 Users 與 Groups 出現在 Directory 底下","Original，因為使用者在 Directory 管理","無法從 Atlassian Administration 判斷，必須聯絡 support"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 238\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Directory\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"236.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 H106 V237.25 H10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 -10,-10 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><line x1=\"106\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"106\" y2=\"238\" class=\"gl\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Atlassian Administration → Directory</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Directory</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Directory</text><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Users</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"145\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Groups</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"171\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"171\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Managed accounts</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"197\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"197\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"189\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Domains</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"189\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><text x=\"14\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Overview</text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"65\" width=\"94\" height=\"22\" rx=\"6\" class=\"sf-brand\"/><text x=\"14\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Directory</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Apps</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Security</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"158\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Insights</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Billing</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"210\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Settings</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"236.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["Centralized user management, because Users and Groups appear under Directory","Original user management, because users are managed from Directory","It can't be determined from Atlassian Administration; the admin must contact support"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方的分辨方法是看 Users 頁在哪裡：在 organization 的 Directory 底下就是 centralized；在 Apps 裡某個 site 底下才是 original。","B":"錯。Original 體驗的 Users 頁位在 Apps 裡選定的 site 底下，每個 site 各自管理使用者，不會出現在 Directory。","C":"錯。官方文件寫明只要看 Users 頁的位置就能判斷，不需要聯絡 support。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/what-is-an-atlassian-organization/","https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/should-i-merge-my-atlassian-organizations/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.1.1-e04","sec":"520.1.1","dom":"520.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An organization admin renames the organization from 'Acme Ltd' to 'Acme Group'. What happens to the organization's org ID?","zh":"Org admin 把 organization 名稱從「Acme Ltd」改成「Acme Group」。這個 organization 的 org ID 會怎樣？","zo":["舊 org ID 再有效 15 天，之後被取代","維持不變","產生新的 org ID，舊的失效"],"fig":"","opts":["The old org ID remains valid for 15 days, then is replaced","It stays the same","A new org ID is generated and the old one stops working"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。15 天是刪除 organization 後可以請 support 還原的期限，和改名無關；改名不會更換 org ID。","B":"對。官方寫明 org admin 可以在 Settings → Details 改 organization 名稱，而且改名不會改變 org ID。名稱只是顯示用，識別碼不受影響。","C":"錯。改名不會產生新的 org ID；官方特別說明 rename 不會改變 organization 的 org ID。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/get-started-with-an-atlassian-organization/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.1.1-e05","sec":"520.1.1","dom":"520.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. An admin wants to delete this organization, which was created by mistake during testing. What must happen first?","zh":"請看圖。Admin 想刪除這個測試時誤建的 organization。必須先做什麼？","zo":["把 organization 內每位使用者都 suspend，再選 Delete organization","把 org admin 角色轉移給 Atlassian support","取消所有 app 訂閱、移除所有網域與 app，並等過保留期"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 203\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Profile\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"201.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Atlassian Administration → Organization settings</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Profile</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Apps in this organization</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"100\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Jira・acme-test</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Standard（Active）</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"129\" width=\"158.5\" height=\"26\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"91.25\" y=\"146\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\">Delete organization</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"178\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s tf-rose\" style=\"font-weight:700\">此 organization 仍有使用中的訂閱</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"201.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["Suspend every user in the organization, then select Delete organization","Transfer the organization admin role to Atlassian support","Cancel all app subscriptions, remove all domains and apps, and wait for the retention period"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Suspend 只是暫停使用者存取，不會取消訂閱或移除 app；只要還有訂閱與 app，就不能刪除 organization。","B":"錯。刪除 organization 由 org admin 自己操作，不需要把角色交給 support；support 是在刪除後 15 天內協助還原。","C":"對。官方列出刪除 organization 的前置步驟：建議先備份、取消每個 site 的所有 app 訂閱、移除所有網域與 app，並等過保留期（通常 14 到 60 天）。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/delete-your-organization/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.1.1-e06","sec":"520.1.1","dom":"520.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An organization admin deleted the wrong organization yesterday. What can the company do?","zh":"Org admin 昨天刪錯了 organization。公司可以怎麼做？","zo":["15 天內聯絡 Atlassian support，還原到刪除當下的狀態","30 天內從 Organization settings 自行還原","沒辦法；刪除的 organization 永遠無法還原"],"fig":"","opts":["Contact Atlassian support within 15 days to restore it to its state at deletion","Restore it from Organization settings within 30 days","Nothing; a deleted organization can never be restored"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方：刪除後 15 天內聯絡 Atlassian support 可以還原。還原只回到刪除當下的狀態，刪除前已移除的網域或 app 不會回來。","B":"錯。Organization settings 裡沒有自助還原的功能；官方說的是 15 天內要聯絡 support，不是 30 天自助還原。","C":"錯。只要在 15 天內聯絡 support 就能還原，雖然只會回到刪除當下的空殼狀態。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/can-i-restore-an-organization/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.1.1-e07","sec":"520.1.1","dom":"520.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A company acquired another business. Both companies have their own Atlassian organization, each with a single site. Leadership wants all users, apps, and bills managed from one place. What is the documented approach?","zh":"一家公司併購了另一家公司，兩家各有自己的 Atlassian organization，各只有一個 site。主管希望所有使用者、app 與帳單在同一處管理。官方的作法是什麼？","zo":["把被併購公司的使用者邀請進既有的 site，兩個 organization 都保留","把一個 organization 的所有 app 轉移到另一個，再刪除不要的 organization","把兩個 organization 連結起來共用一份目錄，但仍各自獨立"],"fig":"","opts":["Invite the acquired company's users into the existing site and keep both organizations","Transfer all apps from one organization to the other, then delete the unwanted organization","Link the two organizations so they share one directory while remaining separate"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。只邀請使用者並不會合併 app 與帳單；被併購公司的 organization、site 與帳單仍是分開管理。","B":"對。官方說明合併 organization 的方式是把所有 app 從一個 organization 轉移到另一個，轉移後刪除不要的那個；這樣使用者、app 與帳單都在同一處。","C":"錯。官方沒有「連結兩個 organization 共用目錄」的功能；要集中管理，就得把 app 轉移到同一個 organization。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/should-i-merge-my-atlassian-organizations/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.1.1-e08","sec":"520.1.1","dom":"520.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Two business units must keep their users and data completely separate. Neither unit's organization admins should be able to administer the other unit's app instances. What should the company do?","zh":"兩個事業單位的使用者與資料必須完全分開，任何一方的 org admin 都不能管理另一方的 app instance。公司應該怎麼做？","zo":["合併成一個 organization，用 group 區隔兩個單位","合併成一個 organization，兩邊的 admin 都只給 site admin 角色","維持兩個獨立的 organization"],"fig":"","opts":["Merge into one organization and separate the units with groups","Merge into one organization and give each unit's admins only the site admin role","Keep two separate organizations"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Group 只控制誰能用哪些 app；合併後的 org admin 仍能管理所有 app instance 與所有使用者，做不到完全隔離。","B":"錯。只給 site admin 雖然限制了這兩群 admin，但合併後的 org admin 仍管得到兩邊；官方建議需要完全隔離時保持分開。","C":"對。官方指出合併等於讓同一群 org admin 管理所有 app instance 與相關的人；需要把使用者族群與資料完全隔離時，就應該保持分開的 organization。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/should-i-merge-my-atlassian-organizations/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.1.1-e09","sec":"520.1.1","dom":"520.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An organization has two Jira sites. Its admin wants to merge it into another organization without involving Atlassian support. What does the documentation say?","zh":"一個 organization 有兩個 Jira site。Admin 想在不找 Atlassian support 的情況下把它合併到另一個 organization。官方文件怎麼說？","zo":["來源或目的地任一方有多個 site，就不能自行合併","只要兩邊都是 centralized user management 就能自行合併","把來源 organization 升級成 Enterprise 後就能自行合併"],"fig":"","opts":["They can't merge it themselves if either the source or destination has multiple sites","They can merge it themselves as long as both organizations use centralized user management","They can merge it themselves after upgrading the source organization to Enterprise"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方寫明：來源或目的地任一方有多個 site，就不能自己合併 organization，需要聯絡 support 討論可行的方式。同一頁另提到 original user management 的 organization 可以自行轉移 app，但這是例外說明，主規則仍是多 site 不能自行合併。","B":"錯。Centralized user management 不會讓多 site 的 organization 變成可以自行合併；centralized 的合併也要符合條件並由 support 協助。","C":"錯。升級到 Enterprise 沒有幫助，官方說 Enterprise 方案的 organization 本身就視為有多個 site。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/should-i-merge-my-atlassian-organizations/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.1.1-e10","sec":"520.1.1","dom":"520.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. An admin needs to review the organization's audit log. Which area of Atlassian Administration should they open?","zh":"請看圖。Admin 需要查看 organization 的 audit log，應該打開 Atlassian Administration 的哪一區？","zo":["Directory","Insights","Security"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 238\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Overview\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"236.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 H106 V237.25 H10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 -10,-10 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><line x1=\"106\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"106\" y2=\"238\" class=\"gl\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Atlassian Administration → Overview</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Overview</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Monthly active users</text><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Jira</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">42</text><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"145\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Confluence</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">35</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Access requests</text><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"196\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"196\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"188\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Pending</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"188\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">3</text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"39\" width=\"94\" height=\"22\" rx=\"6\" class=\"sf-brand\"/><text x=\"14\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Overview</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Directory</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Apps</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Security</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"158\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Insights</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Billing</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"210\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Settings</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"236.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["Directory","Insights","Security"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Directory 用來管理 users、groups、managed accounts、service accounts 與 domains，不包含 audit log。","B":"對。官方的導覽說明：Insights 提供分析與報表工具，可以用 audit log 監看 organization 內的活動，也能看 app 使用量與安全實務。","C":"錯。Security 是管理安全、合規與登入設定的地方，例如 authentication policies 與 IP 限制，不是查看 audit log 的位置。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/explore-an-atlassian-organization/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.1.1-e11","sec":"520.1.1","dom":"520.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Jane uses a personal email address that no organization has claimed. She works in Jira sites that belong to two different organizations. Which statement is correct?","zh":"Jane 使用一個沒有被任何 organization claim 的個人 email。她在分屬兩個 organization 的 Jira site 工作。哪一個說法正確？","zo":["她的帳號屬於她最先取得 app 存取的那個 organization","她需要為每個 organization 各建立一個 Atlassian 帳號","除非某個 organization 透過已驗證網域 claim 她的帳號，否則帳號不屬於任何一方"],"fig":"","opts":["Her account belongs to the organization where she first got app access","She needs a separate Atlassian account for each organization","Her account isn't tied to either organization unless one of them claims it through a verified domain"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。第一次取得存取的 organization 並不會因此擁有這個帳號；沒有被 claim 的帳號對兩邊來說都是 external user。","B":"錯。同一個 Atlassian 帳號就能使用不同 organization 的 app，不需要為每個 organization 各建一個帳號。","C":"對。官方說明使用者不綁 app，也不綁 organization；要等某個 organization 驗證網域並 claim 帳號，它才成為那個 organization 的 managed account。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/what-is-an-atlassian-organization/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.1.1-e12","sec":"520.1.1","dom":"520.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An organization admin adds Confluence to the organization from Apps > Atlassian apps > Add app. What happens to groups?","zh":"Org admin 從 Apps > Atlassian apps > Add app 把 Confluence 加進 organization。Group 會怎樣？","zo":["為 Confluence 的每個角色建立 default group，例如 confluence-users-{site}","既有 jira-users group 的成員自動取得 Confluence 存取","Admin 手動建立之前，不會產生任何 group"],"fig":"","opts":["A default group is created for each Confluence app role, such as confluence-users-{site}","Members of the existing jira-users group automatically get Confluence access","No groups are created until the admin creates them manually"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方：把 app 加進 organization 時，系統會為這個 app 的每個角色建立一個 default group，例如 Confluence 的 confluence-users-{site} 與 confluence-admins-{site}。","B":"錯。Jira 的 default group 只給 Jira 的角色；要讓這些人用 Confluence，得另外給他們 Confluence 的角色。","C":"錯。Default group 是加 app 時自動建立的，不需要 admin 手動建立；admin 之後可以改用別的 group 當 default group。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/default-groups-and-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.1.2-e13","sec":"520.1.2","dom":"520.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Jira Standard site on monthly billing adds 20 new users. Five of them haven't accepted their invitation or logged in yet. How many of the 20 new users count toward billing?","zh":"一個月繳的 Jira Standard 站台新增了 20 位使用者，其中 5 位還沒接受邀請也沒登入。這 20 位新使用者有幾位計入計費？","zo":["15","每位使用者第一次登入前都是 0","20"],"fig":"","opts":["15","0 until each user logs in for the first time","20"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。扣掉沒接受邀請的 5 人是常見誤解；官方寫明沒接受邀請、沒登入的人也照樣計入。","B":"錯。計費不是從第一次登入才開始；只要有 app 存取就計入，跟登入與否無關。","C":"對。官方：使用者一被加進 app 就自動計入計費，即使沒有接受邀請或沒有登入也一樣。計費看的是有沒有 app 存取，不是有沒有使用。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/subscriptions-and-billing/docs/manage-users-and-user-tiers/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.1.2-e14","sec":"520.1.2","dom":"520.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Jira site on the Free plan already has 10 users. The admin adds an 11th user. What happens?","zh":"一個 Free 方案的 Jira 站台已經有 10 位使用者，admin 再加入第 11 位。會發生什麼事？","zo":["站台自動轉成 Standard 方案試用","第 11 位使用者被擋下，直到移除另一位使用者","站台立刻以 Premium 方案向 11 位使用者收費"],"fig":"","opts":["The site automatically moves to a Standard plan trial","The 11th user is blocked until another user is removed","The site is immediately billed for 11 users on the Premium plan"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方：Free 方案最多 10 位使用者，再加人會自動從 Free 轉成 Standard 方案的試用；之後把人數降回來，也可以再切回 Free。","B":"錯。系統不會擋下第 11 位使用者，而是自動把方案轉成 Standard 試用。","C":"錯。超過人數上限轉成的是 Standard 試用，不是 Premium，而且試用期間不會立刻收費。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/subscriptions-and-billing/docs/manage-users-and-user-tiers/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.1.2-e15","sec":"520.1.2","dom":"520.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An admin upgrades a Confluence site from Free to Premium. Which statement is correct?","zh":"Admin 把 Confluence 站台從 Free 升級到 Premium。哪一個說法正確？","zo":["Premium 立刻生效，並有 14 天試用","Premium 立刻生效，並有 30 天試用","Premium 從下個計費期開始"],"fig":"","opts":["The Premium plan starts immediately with a 14-day trial","The Premium plan starts immediately with a 30-day trial","The Premium plan starts at the next billing period"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。14 天是 Standard 方案的試用期；Premium 的試用期是 30 天。","B":"對。從 Free 升級到付費方案會立刻生效並先試用，試用結束才收費；Premium 的試用期是 30 天，期間可以使用方案的全部功能。","C":"錯。下個計費期才生效的是「從付費方案降回 Free」；從 Free 升級是立刻生效。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/subscriptions-and-billing/docs/manage-your-bill-for-standard-and-premium-plans/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.1.2-e16","sec":"520.1.2","dom":"520.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A site was upgraded from Free to a Standard trial and now has 25 users. The trial ends and no payment details were added. What happens?","zh":"一個站台從 Free 升級到 Standard 試用，現在有 25 位使用者。試用結束時沒有加上付款資料。會發生什麼事？","zo":["站台退回 Free，多出的 15 位使用者被暫停","站台維持 Standard，並把帳單 email 給 org admin","訂閱被停用"],"fig":"","opts":["The site reverts to the Free plan and the extra 15 users are suspended","The site stays on Standard and an invoice is emailed to the organization admin","The subscription is deactivated"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。退回 Free 只適用於 10 人以內的情況；系統不會自動挑人 suspend 來湊進 Free 的上限。","B":"錯。沒有付款資料時，訂閱不會繼續停在 Standard；官方提醒要在試用結束前加上付款資料。","C":"對。官方：試用結束時若沒有付款資料，使用者超過 10 人的訂閱會被停用；10 人以內的才會退回 Free 方案。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/subscriptions-and-billing/docs/manage-your-bill-for-standard-and-premium-plans/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.1.2-e17","sec":"520.1.2","dom":"520.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Halfway through a monthly billing cycle, an admin changes a Jira subscription from Premium to Free. Which statement is correct?","zh":"月繳計費週期過了一半時，admin 把 Jira 訂閱從 Premium 改成 Free。哪一個說法正確？","zo":["下個計費期生效、不退還剩餘天數，並移除 sandbox","立刻生效並退還剩餘天數","立刻生效，sandbox 保留 30 天"],"fig":"","opts":["The change takes effect in the next billing period, remaining days aren't refunded, and any sandbox is removed","The change takes effect immediately and the remaining days are refunded","The change takes effect immediately, and sandboxes are kept for 30 days"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方：從付費方案降回 Free 會在下個計費期生效，不退還本期剩餘天數；從 Premium 降回 Free 還會移除這個 app 的 sandbox。","B":"錯。降回 Free 不會立刻生效，也不退費；官方寫明不退還計費週期剩下的天數。","C":"錯。降級從下個計費期生效；而且從 Premium 降回 Free 會移除 sandbox，不會保留 30 天。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/subscriptions-and-billing/docs/manage-your-bill-for-standard-and-premium-plans/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.1.2-e18","sec":"520.1.2","dom":"520.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Mia is an organization admin in an organization with the improved billing experience. She needs to update the company credit card and download last month's invoice. What should be done?","zh":"請看圖。Mia 是 org admin，organization 使用 improved billing 體驗。她需要更新公司信用卡並下載上個月的發票。應該怎麼做？","zo":["不用做什麼；org admin 本來就能管理付款方式與發票","從 Billing permissions 把 Mia 加為 billing admin","給 Mia 每個 site 的 site admin 角色"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 179\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Billing permissions\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"177.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">admin.atlassian.com/billing → Billing permissions</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Billing permissions</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Billing admins</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Alex Chen</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Billing admin</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"129\" width=\"113.5\" height=\"26\" rx=\"6\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><text x=\"68.75\" y=\"146\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"w\">Add new admin</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"177.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["Nothing; organization admins can already manage payment methods and invoices","Add Mia as a billing admin from Billing permissions","Assign Mia the site admin role for each site"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Org admin 只有有限的帳單權限；沒有 billing admin 權限就進不了 Billing accounts 頁，也不能付發票、改付款方式。","B":"對。付款方式與發票只有 billing admin 能管理。現任 billing admin（圖中的 Alex）可以在 Billing permissions 按 Add new admin 加入 Mia。","C":"錯。Site admin 和 org admin 一樣只有有限的帳單權限，能升降方案、停用訂閱、看帳單預估，但不能管付款方式與發票。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/subscriptions-and-billing/docs/understand-billing-administration/","https://support.atlassian.com/subscriptions-and-billing/docs/billing-permissions-by-role/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.1.2-e19","sec":"520.1.2","dom":"520.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Alex is the only billing admin on a billing account and is leaving the company. An admin opens Billing permissions but can't find the option to remove Alex. Why?","zh":"Alex 是某個 billing account 唯一的 billing admin，即將離職。Admin 打開 Billing permissions，卻找不到移除 Alex 的選項。為什麼？","zo":["只有 Atlassian support 能移除 billing admin","必須先把 Alex 移出 org-admins group","帳戶只有一位 billing admin 時，不會出現 Remove billing admin 選項"],"fig":"","opts":["Only Atlassian support can remove a billing admin","Alex must first be removed from the org-admins group","The Remove billing admin option isn't available when an account has only one billing admin"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Billing admin 可以在 Billing permissions 自行新增或移除其他 billing admin，不需要 support；只是不能移除最後一位。","B":"錯。Billing admin 與 org-admins group 是兩套權限；把 Alex 移出 org-admins 不會影響他的 billing admin 身分。","C":"對。官方：只有一位 billing admin 的帳戶不會出現 Remove billing admin 選項。要先加入另一位 billing admin，再移除 Alex；官方也建議至少保留兩位。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/subscriptions-and-billing/docs/understand-billing-administration/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.1.2-e20","sec":"520.1.2","dom":"520.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"In the improved billing experience, an admin deactivates a paid monthly Jira Standard subscription in the middle of the subscription period. When is the subscription deactivated?","zh":"在 improved billing 體驗中，admin 在訂閱期中途停用一個月繳的付費 Jira Standard 訂閱。這個訂閱何時被停用？","zo":["目前訂閱期結束後 15 天","立刻","當天結束時"],"fig":"","opts":["15 days after the end of the current subscription period","Immediately","At the end of the current day"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方的 Deactivate a subscription 頁：停用會排定在目前訂閱期結束後 15 天生效，在那之前仍可使用，也可以用 Undo deactivation 取消排定。","B":"錯。立即停用的是 Free 方案的訂閱；付費訂閱會排定在訂閱期結束後再過 15 天停用。","C":"錯。停用不是當天生效；付費訂閱會等目前訂閱期結束，再過 15 天才停用。"},"note":"官方 Delete your organization 頁對 improved billing 舉的例子與此不一致（寫成訂閱期結束當天停用）；本題依 Deactivate a subscription 頁作答。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/subscriptions-and-billing/docs/cancel-a-subscription/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":1},{"id":"520.1.2-e21","sec":"520.1.2","dom":"520.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An admin deactivates a Confluence subscription that is on the Free plan. What happens?","zh":"Admin 停用一個 Free 方案的 Confluence 訂閱。會發生什麼事？","zo":["經過 60 天保留期後停用","訂閱立即停用","當月結束後 15 天停用"],"fig":"","opts":["The subscription is deactivated after a 60-day retention period","The subscription is deactivated immediately","The subscription is deactivated 15 days after the end of the month"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。60 天是 improved billing 下刪除 organization 前，app 停用後還要等待的時間，不是 Free 訂閱的停用時間。","B":"對。官方：Free 方案的訂閱一停用就立即生效；這個 app 的 sandbox 也會被永久移除、資料刪除。","C":"錯。訂閱期結束後 15 天才停用的是付費訂閱；Free 方案沒有計費期，停用是立即生效。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/subscriptions-and-billing/docs/cancel-a-subscription/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.1.2-e22","sec":"520.1.2","dom":"520.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An organization subscribes to Atlassian Guard Standard. 100 people have access to Jira on a Standard plan, and 50 of them also have access to Confluence on a Standard plan. How many users are on the Atlassian Guard Standard bill?","zh":"一個 organization 訂閱了 Atlassian Guard Standard。有 100 人可以用 Standard 方案的 Jira，其中 50 人也能用 Standard 方案的 Confluence。Guard Standard 帳單上有幾位使用者？","zo":["150","50","100"],"fig":"","opts":["150","50","100"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。150 是把同時用兩個 app 的人重複算了；Guard Standard 每位使用者只算一次。","B":"錯。50 只算了同時有兩個 app 的人；只用 Jira 的另外 50 人也有支援 app 的存取，同樣計入。","C":"對。Atlassian Guard Standard 按 organization 計費，每位使用者只算一次，不論他能用幾個 app。官方範例就是 100 人用 Jira、其中 50 人也用 Confluence，計費人數為 100。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/subscriptions-and-billing/docs/manage-your-bill-for-atlassian-access/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.1.2-e23","sec":"520.1.2","dom":"520.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which statement about the Enterprise plan for Jira and Confluence is correct?","zh":"關於 Jira 與 Confluence 的 Enterprise 方案，哪一個說法正確？","zo":["年繳、在 organization 層級計費，最多 150 個 app instance，並內含 Atlassian Guard Standard","可以月繳，並和 Standard、Premium 一樣出現在每個 site 的帳單","和 Standard、Premium 一樣，每個訂閱只含一個 app instance"],"fig":"","opts":["It's billed annually at the organization level, allows up to 150 app instances, and includes Atlassian Guard Standard","It can be billed monthly and appears in each site's bill like Standard and Premium","Like Standard and Premium, it includes one app instance per subscription"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方：Enterprise 只能年繳，在 organization 層級計費；同一個方案最多 150 個 app instance，並內含 Atlassian Guard Standard。","B":"錯。Enterprise 要求年繳，而且在 organization 層級計費，不會出現在 site 的帳單裡；按 site 各自計費的是 Standard 與 Premium。","C":"錯。每個訂閱只含一個 instance 的是 Free、Standard、Premium；Enterprise 一個方案最多可有 150 個 instance。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/subscriptions-and-billing/docs/manage-your-bill-for-enterprise-plans/","https://support.atlassian.com/subscriptions-and-billing/docs/manage-your-bill-for-standard-and-premium-plans/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.1.2-e24","sec":"520.1.2","dom":"520.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. How many of these users count toward the Jira subscription bill?","zh":"請看圖。這些使用者中，有幾位計入 Jira 訂閱的帳單？","zo":["3","2","1"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 219\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Users\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"217.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Atlassian Administration → Directory → Users</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Users</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Jira・labjira</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"100\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-green\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Leo — User</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Active</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"126\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-gray\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"145\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Kim — User</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Suspended</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"152\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"171\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"171\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Ana — User</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Invited（未接受）</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"178\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-violet\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"197\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"197\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"189\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Sam — User access admin</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"189\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Active</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"217.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["3","2","1"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。3 人是把 Kim 也算進去了；官方說明存取被 suspend 的使用者在暫停期間不計費。","B":"對。Leo 有 Jira 存取，計入；Ana 雖然還沒接受邀請，被加進 Jira 就計入。Kim 已被 suspend，不計費；Sam 只是 user access admin，該 group 不給 app 存取。","C":"錯。只算 Leo 是漏掉了 Ana；官方寫明被加進 app 的人，沒接受邀請、沒登入也照樣計費。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/subscriptions-and-billing/docs/manage-users-and-user-tiers/","https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/remove-or-suspend-a-user/","https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/default-groups-and-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.1.3-e25","sec":"520.1.3","dom":"520.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An organization admin wants an HR coordinator to manage who can access Confluence, without giving them any other admin rights. Which role should the HR coordinator get?","zh":"Org admin 想讓 HR 專員管理誰可以使用 Confluence，但不給其他任何 admin 權限。HR 專員應該拿到哪個角色？","zo":["Confluence 的 app admin","Confluence 的 user access admin","Site admin"],"fig":"","opts":["App admin for Confluence","User access admin for Confluence","Site admin"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。App admin 管的是 Confluence 本身的設定，例如全域權限與外觀，給的權限比需求多，而且重點不在管理誰能存取。","B":"對。User access admin 的主要職責就是管理自己負責的 app 的使用者存取；它不給 app 設定權限，也不會自動給 app 存取，符合「只管誰能用 Confluence」。","C":"錯。Site admin 管的是整個 site：加 app、管 Marketplace app；在 centralized 體驗下甚至不能邀請或修改使用者，不符合需求。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/what-are-the-different-types-of-admin-roles/","https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/give-users-admin-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.1.3-e26","sec":"520.1.3","dom":"520.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Kim is a user access admin for Confluence. She tries to make a colleague an app admin for Jira, but she can't. Why?","zh":"Kim 是 Confluence 的 user access admin。她想讓同事成為 Jira 的 app admin，卻做不到。為什麼？","zo":["User access admin 不能為任何 app 指派 app admin","同事必須先被加進 site-admins group","Jira 家族的 app admin 只有 org admin 能指派"],"fig":"","opts":["User access admins can't make anyone an app admin for any app","The colleague must first be added to the site-admins group","For the Jira family, only an organization admin can make another user an app admin"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。User access admin 可以為自己管理的 app 指派 app admin（例如 Confluence）；做不到的只有 Jira 家族。","B":"錯。site-admins group（centralized）給的是 org admin 角色，和指派 Jira app admin 的限制無關，也不是前置條件。","C":"對。User access admin 可以為自己管理的 app 指派 app admin，但 Jira 家族是例外：只有 org admin 能讓別人成為 Jira 的 app admin。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/what-are-the-different-types-of-admin-roles/","https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/give-users-admin-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.1.3-e27","sec":"520.1.3","dom":"520.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"In an organization with centralized user management, who can assign the site admin role to a user?","zh":"在 centralized user management 的 organization 中，誰可以把 site admin 角色指派給使用者？","zo":["只有 org admin","Org admin 與現有的 site admin","Org admin、site admin 與 user access admin"],"fig":"","opts":["Organization admins only","Organization admins and existing site admins","Organization admins, site admins, and user access admins"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。Centralized 體驗下，官方寫明只有 org admin 能指派或移除 site admin 角色；作法是在使用者頁的 ••• 選單選 Assign site admin role。","B":"錯。Site admin 能指派其他 site admin 是 original 體驗的規則；centralized 體驗只有 org admin 可以。","C":"錯。User access admin 只管自己 app 的使用者存取，不能指派任何 admin 層級的 site 角色。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/what-are-the-different-types-of-admin-roles/","https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/give-users-admin-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.1.3-e28","sec":"520.1.3","dom":"520.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. An organization admin opens the Grant access dialog for Kim and wants to make Kim a user access admin for Jira Administration. The role isn't offered. Why?","zh":"請看圖。Org admin 打開 Kim 的 Grant access 對話框，想讓 Kim 成為 Jira Administration 的 user access admin，卻沒有這個選項。為什麼？","zo":["User access admin 只能從 Groups 頁授予","Jira Administration 唯一能授予的角色是 App admin","Kim 必須先有 Jira 的 User 角色，才能授予任何 admin 角色"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 286\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Grant access：Kim\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"284.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Atlassian Administration → Directory → Users</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Grant access：Kim</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Roles</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Jira</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">User</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"145\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Jira Administration</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">App admin</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"171\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"171\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Confluence</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">User</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"192\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Jira Administration</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"198\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx brand\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"216\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">App admin</text><path d=\"M350,209 l5,5 l5,-5\" class=\"ln ink\" style=\"stroke-width:1.6\"/><rect x=\"12\" y=\"236\" width=\"106.0\" height=\"26\" rx=\"6\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><text x=\"65.0\" y=\"253\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"w\">Grant access</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"284.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["User access admin can only be granted from the Groups page","App admin is the only role that can be granted for Jira Administration","Kim must have the Jira User role before any admin role can be granted"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。User access admin 就是在 Grant access 對話框的 Roles 欄授予；group 只是另一種方式，不是唯一入口。","B":"對。官方：Jira 家族共用同一個管理介面，所以要讓人成為 Jira 的 app admin 是改 Jira Administration 這一列，而這一列唯一能給的角色就是 App admin。","C":"錯。Admin 角色不需要先有 User 角色；官方甚至提醒 admin 角色不一定附帶 app 存取，要用 app 得另外給 User 角色。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/give-users-admin-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.1.3-e29","sec":"520.1.3","dom":"520.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A user was just made an app admin for Jira. They can open the Jira settings to edit workflows, but they can't see any work items in Jira. What is the most likely cause?","zh":"某位使用者剛成為 Jira 的 app admin。他可以打開 Jira 設定編輯 workflow，卻看不到 Jira 裡的任何 work item。最可能的原因？","zo":["App admin 還需要每個 space 的 Administer Projects 權限","App admin 需要 site admin 角色才能看到內容","Jira 的 app admin 不會自動有 app 存取，需要 Jira 的 User 角色"],"fig":"","opts":["App admins also need the Administer Projects permission in every space","App admins need the site admin role to view content","Jira app admins don't get app access automatically, so they need the Jira User role"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Administer Projects（Administer Spaces）是管理單一 space 的權限，和能不能使用 Jira、看到 work item 的 app 存取是兩回事。","B":"錯。Site admin 管的是 site 與上面的 app 安裝，不會給 app 存取；官方說 site admin 要用 Jira 功能同樣需要 Jira 授權。","C":"對。官方：Jira 的 app admin 不會自動取得 app 存取，要另外授予 Jira 的 User 角色。其他 app 的 app admin 通常可以存取內容，Jira 家族是例外。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/what-are-the-different-types-of-admin-roles/","https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/give-users-admin-permissions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.1.3-e30","sec":"520.1.3","dom":"520.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An organization admin adds Leo to the org-admins group. What is the result?","zh":"Org admin 把 Leo 加進 org-admins group。結果是什麼？","zo":["Leo 取得 org admin 角色","Leo 成為每個 site 的 site admin，但不是 org admin","還要從使用者的 ••• 選單指派角色，否則不會有任何改變"],"fig":"","opts":["Leo receives the organization admin role","Leo becomes a site admin for every site but not an organization admin","Nothing changes until the role is also assigned from the user's ••• menu"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。授予 admin 角色時系統會把人加進對應的 default group；反過來，把人加進該 group 也等於授予角色。org-admins（或 site-admins）這個 group 給的就是 org admin 角色。","B":"錯。這個 group 給的是 org admin 角色，不是 site admin；而且 centralized 體驗下 site admin 角色不能用 group 授予。","C":"錯。官方明列「把人加進對應的 default group」是授予 admin 角色的另一種方式，不需要再從 ••• 選單指派一次。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/give-users-admin-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.1.3-e31","sec":"520.1.3","dom":"520.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. This organization uses centralized user management. An admin adds Leo to the site-admins group. What role does Leo get?","zh":"請看圖。這個 organization 使用 centralized user management。Admin 把 Leo 加進 site-admins group。Leo 會得到什麼角色？","zo":["沒有角色，因為 site-admins 是舊的 group","Org admin","每個 site 的 site admin"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 219\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Groups\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"217.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Atlassian Administration → Directory → Groups</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Groups</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Groups</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"100\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">site-admins</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Organization admin</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"126\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"145\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">jira-admins-acme</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">App admin（Jira）</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"152\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-teal\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"171\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"171\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">jira-users-acme</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">User（Jira）</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"178\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-teal\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"197\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"197\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"189\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">confluence-users-acme</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"189\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">User（Confluence）</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"217.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["No role, because site-admins is a legacy group","Organization admin","Site admin for every site"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。這個 group 仍然有效，而且權限最高；把人加進去就是給他 org admin 角色，不是沒有作用的舊 group。","B":"對。官方：依 organization 建立的時間，給 org admin 角色的 group 叫 org-admins 或 site-admins，兩者只會有其中一個；不論名稱為何，這個 group 都給 org admin 角色。","C":"錯。名稱容易誤會，但 centralized 體驗下的 site-admins group 對應 org admin 角色；site admin 角色本身不能透過 group 授予。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/give-users-admin-permissions/","https://support.atlassian.com/atlassian-cloud/kb/site-administrator-role-in-the-centralized-user-management-and-original-user-management-experiences/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.1.3-e32","sec":"520.1.3","dom":"520.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An organization admin tries to make the org-admins group the default group for the Jira User role. What happens?","zh":"Org admin 想把 org-admins group 設成 Jira User 角色的 default group。會發生什麼事？","zo":["允許，之後每位新的 Jira 使用者也都成為 org admin","只有在 original user management 體驗才允許","不允許，給 org admin 角色的 group 不能當 default group"],"fig":"","opts":["It's allowed, and every new Jira user also becomes an organization admin","It's allowed only in the original user management experience","It isn't allowed, because the group that grants the organization admin role can't be a default group"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。正是為了避免這種後果，官方禁止把給 org admin 角色的 group 設成 default group。","B":"錯。官方的規則沒有區分 original 或 centralized；給 org admin 角色的 group 一律不能當 default group。","C":"對。官方：給 org admin 角色的 group 不能是任何角色的 default group，目的是避免有人在被授予其他角色時意外成為 org admin。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/default-groups-and-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.1.3-e33","sec":"520.1.3","dom":"520.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A company's only organization admin has left and can't be contacted. Nobody else has admin access to the organization. What should the company do?","zh":"公司唯一的 org admin 已離職且聯絡不到，沒有其他人有這個 organization 的 admin 權限。公司應該怎麼做？","zo":["聯絡 Atlassian support 啟動角色轉移流程","讓某位 site admin 把自己升為 org admin","刪除這個 organization 再建一個新的"],"fig":"","opts":["Contact Atlassian support to start a role transfer process","Have a site admin promote themselves to organization admin","Delete the organization and create a new one"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方：org admin 聯絡不到時，請 Atlassian support 啟動角色轉移；support 會先聯絡現任 admin 請他同意，三天內沒有回應，驗證後就能轉移。","B":"錯。只有 org admin 能新增或管理其他 org admin；site admin 沒有權限把自己升成 org admin。","C":"錯。沒有 org admin 根本無法刪除 organization，而且刪除會失去所有設定；正確作法是請 support 轉移角色。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/give-users-admin-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.1.3-e34","sec":"520.1.3","dom":"520.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Jira space admin has the Administer Spaces permission but not Administer Jira. Which task can they perform?","zh":"某位 Jira space admin 有 Administer Spaces 權限，但沒有 Administer Jira。他可以做哪件事？","zo":["變更這個 space 的 category","管理 space role 成員、components 與 versions","替這個 space 換一個 permission scheme"],"fig":"","opts":["Change the space's category","Manage space role membership, components, and versions","Select a different permission scheme for the space"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。官方寫明變更 Jira space 的 category 需要 Administer Jira 全域權限，space admin 做不到。","B":"對。官方：沒有 Administer Jira 的 space admin 仍可以改 space 名稱、描述、lead，管理 space role 成員，定義 components 與 versions。","C":"錯。Space admin 只能檢視 space 用的 scheme，不能選擇或編輯；換 permission scheme 要有 Administer Jira 的 Jira admin。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.1.3-e35","sec":"520.1.3","dom":"520.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Confluence admin with the Confluence Administrator global permission can't manage the permissions of a space whose only space admin has left the company. What should they do?","zh":"一位有 Confluence Administrator 全域權限的 Confluence admin，無法管理某個 space 的權限，因為這個 space 唯一的 space admin 已離職。他應該怎麼做？","zo":["請 org admin 讓他成為 site admin","刪除這個 space 再重建","在 Confluence administration 對該 space 使用 Recover Permissions"],"fig":"","opts":["Ask an organization admin to make them a site admin","Delete the space and recreate it","Use Recover Permissions for that space in Confluence administration"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Site admin 管的是 site 與 app 安裝，不是 Confluence 單一 space 的權限；Confluence 本身就提供 Recover Permissions 解決這個問題。","B":"錯。刪除 space 會連內容一起刪掉，代價太大；用 Recover Permissions 就能取回 space 的管理權。","C":"對。官方 KB：有 Confluence Administrator 全域權限，不代表有每個 space 的權限。在 Confluence administration 的 Space permissions 對該 space 選 Recover Permissions，就會取得它的 Admin 權限。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/atlassian-cloud/kb/how-to-give-a-user-or-group-admin-permissions-to-all-spaces/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.1.3-e36","sec":"520.1.3","dom":"520.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Kim is a site admin in an organization with centralized user management. She needs to invite a contractor to Jira on this site. What is required?","zh":"請看圖。Kim 是 centralized user management 下的 site admin，她需要邀請一位外包人員使用這個 site 的 Jira。需要什麼？","zo":["Kim 還需要 Jira 的 user access admin 角色，或由 org admin 邀請","不需要；site admin 可以邀請使用者到自己管理的 site","Kim 需要 Jira Administration 的 app admin 角色"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 238\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Kim Lee\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"236.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 H106 V237.25 H10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 -10,-10 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><line x1=\"106\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"106\" y2=\"238\" class=\"gl\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Atlassian Administration → Directory → Users</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Kim Lee</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Site administration</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"100\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">labjira</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Site admin</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"140\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">App access</text><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"170\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"162\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Jira</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"162\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">User</text><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"196\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"196\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"188\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Confluence</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"188\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">User</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Overview</text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"65\" width=\"94\" height=\"22\" rx=\"6\" class=\"sf-brand\"/><text x=\"14\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Directory</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Apps</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Security</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"158\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Insights</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Billing</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"210\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Settings</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"236.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["Kim also needs the user access admin role for Jira, or an organization admin must invite the contractor","Nothing; site admins can invite users to the sites they administer","Kim needs the app admin role for Jira Administration"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。Centralized 體驗下，site admin 不能邀請或修改任何使用者，即使在自己管理的 site 也一樣。官方 KB 建議同時給 site admin 與 user access admin 角色，讓她能邀請人到自己管的 app。","B":"錯。Site admin 能邀請使用者是 original 體驗的規則；centralized 體驗把這項工作交給 org admin 與 user access admin。","C":"錯。Jira 的 app admin 管 Jira 內的設定，不能進 Atlassian Administration 邀請使用者。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/atlassian-cloud/kb/site-administrator-role-in-the-centralized-user-management-and-original-user-management-experiences/","https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/what-are-the-different-types-of-admin-roles/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.1.3-e37","sec":"520.1.3","dom":"520.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which statement about the organization admin role is correct?","zh":"關於 org admin 角色，哪一個說法正確？","zo":["即使持有 app admin 角色，org admin 也永遠不能設定 app","系統會自動給 org admin 每個 app 的 user 與 app admin 角色，但這些角色可以移除","Org admin 角色本身就給所有 app 的存取，而且無法移除"],"fig":"","opts":["Organization admins can never configure app settings, even if they hold the app admin role","Organization admins are given the user and app admin roles for every app automatically, but these roles can be removed","The organization admin role itself grants access to every app, and that access can't be removed"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Org admin 持有 app admin 角色時就能設定該 app；官方說的是「org admin 角色本身」不包含這個能力。","B":"對。官方：系統會自動給 org admin 每個 app 的 user 與 app admin 角色，但可以移除；org admin 角色本身不給 app 存取，也不給設定 app 的能力。","C":"錯。Org admin 角色本身並不給 app 存取；能用 app 是因為系統另外自動給了 user 角色，而這個角色可以被移除。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/what-are-the-different-types-of-admin-roles/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.1.3-e38","sec":"520.1.3","dom":"520.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team lead needs to add new Atlassian apps to the company's engineering site and manage the Marketplace apps installed there. They must not manage users or organization security settings. Which role best fits?","zh":"一位團隊主管需要在公司的工程 site 加入新的 Atlassian app，並管理裝在上面的 Marketplace app，但不能管理使用者或 organization 的安全設定。哪個角色最合適？","zo":["Org admin","Jira 的 user access admin","工程 site 的 site admin"],"fig":"","opts":["Organization admin","User access admin for Jira","Site admin for the engineering site"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Org admin 是最高層級，連使用者、group 與安全政策都能管，給的權限遠超過這位主管的需求。","B":"錯。User access admin 只管某個 app 的使用者存取，不能在 site 加 app，也不能管理 Marketplace app。","C":"對。Site admin 負責管理一個 site：在 site 加 app、管理裝在 site 上的 Marketplace app；在 centralized 體驗下它不能邀請或修改使用者，也不能改安全設定。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/what-are-the-different-types-of-admin-roles/","https://support.atlassian.com/atlassian-cloud/kb/site-administrator-role-in-the-centralized-user-management-and-original-user-management-experiences/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.2.1-e01","sec":"520.2.1","dom":"520.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Two departments each need their own Jira instance with separate admins. The company doesn't have an Enterprise plan. How must the instances be licensed?","zh":"兩個部門各需要一個自己的 Jira instance，由不同的 admin 管理。公司沒有 Enterprise 方案。這些 instance 必須怎麼授權？","zo":["放在一個 Premium 訂閱底下，它最多涵蓋 150 個 instance","放在一個 Standard 訂閱底下，新 site 上的第二個 instance 免費","兩個獨立的 Jira 訂閱，每個 instance 一個"],"fig":"","opts":["Under one Premium subscription, which covers up to 150 instances","Under one Standard subscription, with the second instance free on a new site","As two separate Jira subscriptions, one for each instance"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。最多 150 個 instance 是 Enterprise 方案的規則；Premium 方案仍然只給一個 instance，第二個 instance 要另外訂閱。","B":"錯。開新 site 不會讓第二個 instance 免費；每個 Standard 方案只給一個 instance，新 site 上的 Jira 是另一個要計費的訂閱。","C":"對。Free、Standard、Premium 方案每個只給一個 app instance；需要幾個就訂幾個方案，而且各自分開訂閱。只有 Enterprise 方案能在同一個方案下涵蓋多個 instance。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/how-many-instances-of-a-product-does-my-organization-need/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.2.1-e02","sec":"520.2.1","dom":"520.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A company on a Jira Enterprise plan acquires a subsidiary and wants to give it a separate Jira instance for security and data isolation. What should the admin know?","zh":"一家使用 Jira Enterprise 方案的公司併購了一家子公司，基於安全與資料隔離，想給子公司一個獨立的 Jira instance。Admin 應該知道什麼？","zo":["同一個 Enterprise 方案可以包含最多 150 個 app instance","每多一個 Jira instance 都需要另一個 Enterprise 方案","Enterprise 方案只允許一個 Jira instance，但 site 數量不限"],"fig":"","opts":["The same Enterprise plan can include up to 150 app instances","Each additional Jira instance requires its own Enterprise plan","An Enterprise plan allows only one Jira instance, but unlimited sites"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。Enterprise 方案可以在同一個方案下有最多 150 個 app instance，官方也指出這能省下可觀成本，讓成本不再是決定誰能用哪個 instance 的因素。","B":"錯。每個 instance 各自訂一個方案，是 Free、Standard、Premium 的規則；Enterprise 的特點正是同一方案涵蓋多個 instance。","C":"錯。Enterprise 方案並沒有限制每個 app 只能有一個 instance；它允許同一方案底下最多 150 個 app instance。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/how-many-instances-of-a-product-does-my-organization-need/","https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/add-a-new-product-to-your-organization/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.2.1-e03","sec":"520.2.1","dom":"520.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An organization admin wants to add Confluence to the company's existing Atlassian organization. Which approach does Atlassian recommend?","zh":"Org admin 想把 Confluence 加到公司既有的 Atlassian organization。Atlassian 建議用哪種方式？","zo":["請 Jira admin 從 Atlassian Marketplace 安裝 Confluence","在 Atlassian Administration 選 Apps → Atlassian apps → Add app","用新的 email 到 www.atlassian.com 註冊 Confluence"],"fig":"","opts":["Ask a Jira admin to install Confluence from the Atlassian Marketplace","In Atlassian Administration, select Apps, then Atlassian apps, then Add app","Sign up for Confluence at www.atlassian.com with a new email address"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Marketplace 是安裝第三方 app 的地方，Confluence 是 Atlassian 自己的 app，要從 Atlassian Administration 加入 organization。","B":"對。官方建議從 Atlassian Administration 的 Apps → Atlassian apps → Add app 新增，才能確定 app 加在既有的 organization 底下；新 app 會從 Standard 或 Premium 試用開始。","C":"錯。從官網也能開新 app，但官方建議從 Atlassian Administration 加；用新 email 第一次註冊 app，會連同新的 site 與 organization 一起建立。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/add-a-new-product-to-your-organization/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.2.1-e04","sec":"520.2.1","dom":"520.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An admin added Jira Service Management from Atlassian Administration and started a trial, but never entered payment details. What happens when the trial ends?","zh":"Admin 從 Atlassian Administration 新增 Jira Service Management 並開始試用，但一直沒有填付款資料。試用結束時會怎樣？","zo":["App 與資料在 30 天後被刪除","App 一直停在試用方案，直到填入付款資料","App 改成 Free 方案"],"fig":"","opts":["The app and its data are deleted after 30 days","The app stays on the trial plan until payment details are added","The app changes to a Free plan"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。官方對沒有付款資料的處理是改成 Free 方案；刪除 app 與資料不是試用結束時的自動行為。","B":"錯。試用有結束的時候；結束後有付款資料就開始付費，沒有付款資料就改成 Free，不會一直停在試用。","C":"對。從 Atlassian Administration 新增的 app 會先以 Standard 或 Premium 試用；試用結束時如果沒有付款資料，Atlassian 會把 app 改成 Free 方案，而不是刪除。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/add-a-new-product-to-your-organization/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.2.1-e05","sec":"520.2.1","dom":"520.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. The admin selects Update URL for acme.atlassian.net and enters acme-corp. What is the result?","zh":"請看圖。Admin 在 acme.atlassian.net 那一列按 Update URL，輸入 acme-corp。結果是什麼？","zo":["該 site 上的 Jira 與 Confluence 都改成 acme-corp.atlassian.net","只有 Jira 改網址，Confluence 要另外更新","兩個 site 上的所有 app 都改成 acme-corp.atlassian.net"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 205\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"App URLs\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"203.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Atlassian Administration → Apps → App URLs</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">App URLs</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Site</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">acme.atlassian.net</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Jira, Confluence</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"145\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">acme-legal.atlassian.net</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Jira</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"155\" width=\"91.0\" height=\"26\" rx=\"6\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><text x=\"57.5\" y=\"172\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"w\">Update URL</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"203.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["Jira and Confluence on that site both move to acme-corp.atlassian.net","Only Jira moves; Confluence must be updated in a separate step","All apps on both sites move to acme-corp.atlassian.net"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。App URL 是以 site 為單位更新的，同一個 site 上的所有 app 一起換成新網址，不能只改其中一個；確認前畫面會列出會使用新網址的 app。","B":"錯。官方明說不能替同一個 site 裡的個別 app 改 URL；Jira 與 Confluence 在同一個 site，會一起改。","C":"錯。圖中 acme-legal 是另一個 site，有自己的網址；更新 acme 這一列只影響這個 site 上的 app。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/can-i-change-the-url-used-to-access-a-product/","https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/update-a-product-url/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.2.1-e06","sec":"520.2.1","dom":"520.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"After the site URL changed from acme.atlassian.net to acme-corp.atlassian.net, users' old bookmarks still work, but a reporting script that calls the Jira REST API now fails with 401 errors. What is the cause?","zh":"Site URL 從 acme.atlassian.net 改成 acme-corp.atlassian.net 後，使用者的舊書籤仍能用，但一個呼叫 Jira REST API 的報表腳本開始回 401 錯誤。原因是什麼？","zo":["Site URL 還沒改完，最多要 72 小時","呼叫舊網址的 REST API 不會轉址，必須改用新網址","改 URL 會撤銷所有使用者的 API token"],"fig":"","opts":["The site URL change hasn't finished; it takes up to 72 hours","REST API calls to the old URL aren't redirected and must use the new URL","Changing the URL revokes every user's API tokens"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。URL 更新最多約 5 分鐘完成；72 小時是網域驗證時 DNS 生效可能需要的時間，和這裡無關。","B":"對。改 URL 後，Atlassian 會在瀏覽器把舊連結轉到新網址，但 REST API 呼叫舊網址會回 401；整合與腳本都要改用新網址。","C":"錯。API token 屬於使用者帳號，官方沒有說改 site URL 會撤銷 token；401 的原因是 API 不會像瀏覽器那樣轉址。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/update-a-product-url/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.2.1-e07","sec":"520.2.1","dom":"520.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An admin set the landing app for a site to Confluence. Thirty minutes later, some users still land in Jira when they visit the site URL. What is the most likely explanation?","zh":"Admin 把某個 site 的 landing app 設成 Confluence。30 分鐘後，有些使用者打開 site 網址仍進到 Jira。最可能的原因是什麼？","zo":["使用者要先登出所有 Atlassian app，landing app 才會改變","Landing app 只套用到變更之後才加入的使用者","這個變更最多要兩小時才生效"],"fig":"","opts":["Users must log out of all Atlassian apps before the landing app changes","The landing app only applies to users added after the change","The change can take up to two hours to take effect"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。官方沒有要求使用者登出；設定生效只和時間有關，最多兩小時。","B":"錯。Landing app 套用到所有造訪 site 網址的使用者，不是只套用到之後新加入的人。","C":"對。官方說明更新 landing app 後，最多可能要兩小時才生效；30 分鐘後仍有人進到 Jira 屬於正常範圍，稍後再確認即可。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/set-your-sites-landing-product/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.2.1-e08","sec":"520.2.1","dom":"520.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A company wants customers to reach its Jira Service Management help center at help.acme.com instead of an atlassian.net address. What is required?","zh":"一家公司想讓客戶用 help.acme.com 進入 Jira Service Management 的 help center，而不是 atlassian.net 網址。需要什麼？","zo":["Custom domain：需要符合條件的付費方案，並加 DNS 紀錄證明擁有網域","把 app URL 的 subdomain 改成 help-acme","Enterprise 方案加上 Atlassian Guard 訂閱"],"fig":"","opts":["A custom domain, which needs a qualifying paid plan and DNS records that prove ownership","Updating the app URL subdomain to help-acme","An Enterprise plan and an Atlassian Guard subscription"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。要用公司自己的網域就是 custom domain：org admin 申請，app 要是付費方案（JSM Standard 就符合），並在 DNS 加紀錄證明擁有網域。","B":"錯。改 subdomain 只能改 atlassian.net 前面那段，網址仍是 help-acme.atlassian.net，無法變成 help.acme.com。","C":"錯。Custom domain 的方案條件是 Jira Premium、Confluence Premium 或 JSM Standard，並不要求 Enterprise 或 Atlassian Guard。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/can-i-change-the-url-used-to-access-a-product/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.2.1-e09","sec":"520.2.1","dom":"520.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An organization's Users list appears under Directory in Atlassian Administration. The admin wants to transfer all of its apps into another organization. What should the admin do?","zh":"某 organization 的 Users 清單在 Atlassian Administration 的 Directory 底下。Admin 想把它所有的 app 轉移到另一個 organization。Admin 應該怎麼做？","zo":["選 Apps → Atlassian apps，用 More actions 逐一搬移 app","聯絡 Atlassian support，因為 centralized user management 不能自助轉移","在這個 organization 選 Organization settings → Profile → Transfer apps"],"fig":"","opts":["Select Apps, then Atlassian apps, then use More actions to move each app","Contact Atlassian support, because self-service transfer isn't available with centralized user management","Select Organization settings, then Profile, then Transfer apps in this organization"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Atlassian apps 頁的 More actions 是用來更新 landing app、連結 Bitbucket 等，沒有逐一搬移 app 到其他 organization 的功能。","B":"對。Users 在 Directory 底下代表是 centralized user management；官方說這種 organization 不能自助轉移 app，要聯絡 support 討論轉移或合併的選項。","C":"錯。Organization settings → Profile → Transfer apps 是自助轉移的位置，但只適用雙方都是 original user management 的 organization。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/transfer-products-to-another-organization/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.2.1-e10","sec":"520.2.1","dom":"520.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Both organizations use the original user management experience. Before starting the transfer of all apps from Beta Corp to Acme, which preparation is required?","zh":"請看圖。兩個 organization 都使用 original user management。要把 Beta Corp 的所有 app 轉移到 Acme 之前，必須做哪項準備？","zo":["從 IdP de-provision 所有 group，讓它們在 Acme 重建","什麼都不用做，SSO、API keys 與 domains 會跟著 app 自動移過去","在 Atlassian 這端中斷 SSO、撤銷 admin API keys、移除 domains"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 217\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Beta Corp\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"215.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Atlassian Administration → Beta Corp</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Beta Corp</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Organization settings</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">SAML single sign-on</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Connected</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"145\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Admin API keys</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">2 active</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"171\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"171\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Domains</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">beta.com・Verified</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"192\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s tf-violet\" style=\"font-weight:700\">Plan: transfer all apps to the Acme organization</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"215.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["De-provision all groups from the identity provider so they're recreated in Acme","Nothing; SSO, API keys, and domains move automatically with the apps","Disconnect SSO on the Atlassian side, revoke the admin API keys, and remove the domains"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。官方特別提醒不要 de-provision 任何 group，而是先在 Atlassian 這端中斷 IdP 連線，才能保留既有的 group 與權限設定。","B":"錯。這些 organization 層級的設定不會跟著 app 走；系統會要求先移除，轉移後在目的 organization 重新建立。","C":"對。轉移前要移除來源 organization 的安全設定（SAML SSO、user provisioning）、撤銷 admin API keys，並移除已驗證與未驗證的 domains；轉移後再到目的 organization 重新設定。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/transfer-products-to-another-organization/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.2.1-e11","sec":"520.2.1","dom":"520.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Pat is an organization admin of Beta Corp. All of Beta Corp's apps are transferred to Acme's organization. What happens to Pat's admin access?","zh":"Pat 是 Beta Corp 的 org admin。Beta Corp 的所有 app 被轉移到 Acme 的 organization。Pat 的 admin 權限會怎樣？","zo":["Pat 成為 Acme 的 org admin，也是所有 site 的 site admin","Pat 失去所有 admin 角色，因為 Beta Corp 的 organization 被刪除了","Pat 只是從 Beta Corp 轉過來的那些 app 的 admin"],"fig":"","opts":["Pat becomes an organization admin of Acme and a site admin for all its sites","Pat loses all admin roles, because Beta Corp's organization is deleted","Pat stays an admin only of the apps transferred from Beta Corp"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方：來源 organization 的 org admin 會成為目的 organization 的 org admin，也會被加為所有 site 的 site admin；不想給這些權限，要在轉移前移除他的 org admin 角色。","B":"錯。空的 Beta Corp organization 確實會被刪除，但它的 org admin 不會失去權限，反而會成為 Acme 的 org admin。","C":"錯。Org admin 是 organization 層級的角色，範圍不只轉移過去的 app；Pat 會管理整個 Acme organization 與所有 site。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/transfer-products-to-another-organization/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.2.1-e12","sec":"520.2.1","dom":"520.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. The landing app for the acme site is set to Confluence. Leo visits https://acme.atlassian.net. What happens?","zh":"請看圖。acme 這個 site 的 landing app 設成 Confluence。Leo 打開 https://acme.atlassian.net，會發生什麼？","zo":["Leo 看到錯誤頁，直到 admin 給他 Confluence 存取","Leo 進到 Confluence，並被提示申請存取","Leo 自動被送到 Jira，因為他沒有 Confluence 存取"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 222\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Update landing app\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"220.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Atlassian Administration → Apps → Atlassian apps</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Update landing app</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">acme</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"95\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx brand\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Confluence</text><path d=\"M350,106 l5,5 l5,-5\" class=\"ln ink\" style=\"stroke-width:1.6\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"144\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Leo&#x27;s app roles</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"155\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-green\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"174\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"174\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Jira</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">User</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"181\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"200\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"192\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Confluence</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"192\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">No access</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"220.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["Leo sees an error until an admin grants him Confluence access","Leo lands in Confluence and is prompted to request access","Leo is sent to Jira automatically, because he has no Confluence access"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Leo 不會只看到錯誤頁；他會看到申請存取的提示，admin 核准後才能使用 Confluence。","B":"對。官方：使用者沒有 landing app 的存取時，系統仍會把他帶到設定的 app，並提示他申請存取；所以 Leo 會進到 Confluence 並看到申請提示。","C":"錯。系統不會自動改送到使用者有存取的 app；landing app 對該 site 的所有使用者都一樣，沒有存取就提示申請。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/set-your-sites-landing-product/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.2.2-e13","sec":"520.2.2","dom":"520.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Jira Premium customer wants most changes to arrive together once a month so the team can prepare training. Which setting should the organization admin change?","zh":"一個 Jira Premium 客戶希望大部分變更每月一次一起到，好讓團隊準備教育訓練。Org admin 應該改哪個設定？","zo":["維持 continuous track，並建立每月的 freeze window","把 Jira 切到 bundled release track","把 Jira 切到 preview release track"],"fig":"","opts":["Keep the continuous track and create a monthly freeze window","Switch the Jira app to the bundled release track","Switch the Jira app to the preview release track"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Freeze window 是在關鍵期間暫時擋住可見變更，而且要 Enterprise 方案；它不是讓變更按月集中推出的設定。","B":"對。Bundled track 會把大部分變更集中在每月第二個週二（22:00 UTC 起）一起推出；Premium 與 Enterprise 的 Jira 都能用，在 Apps → Release management → Release tracks 切換。","C":"錯。Preview track 只給 sandbox 用，讓 sandbox 比 production 早一個月收到同一包變更；production 的 app 不能選 Preview。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/what-are-release-tracks/","https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/get-changes-as-a-group-on-a-monthly-cadence/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.2.2-e14","sec":"520.2.2","dom":"520.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Confluence app is on the bundled release track. Which type of change still rolls out to it as soon as it's available?","zh":"某個 Confluence app 在 bundled release track 上。哪一種變更仍會一推出就送到？","zo":["空間設定裡新增的一個設定","頁面上被移到別處的一個按鈕","安全與效能更新"],"fig":"","opts":["A new setting added to space settings","A button moved to a different place on the page","A security and performance update"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。新增設定屬於需要使用者調整工作方式、但影響不大的可見變更，正是 bundled track 會集中到每月那一包的類型。","B":"錯。移動按鈕是官方舉的 bundled track 典型例子：可見但影響不大的變更，會等到每月那一包才推出。","C":"對。Bundled track 不會延後 bug fix 與安全、效能更新，這些變更一推出就會送到；Opsgenie 支援的 JSM 功能與長期的大型變更也一樣立即推出。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/what-are-release-tracks/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.2.2-e15","sec":"520.2.2","dom":"520.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. The admin wants the sandbox to receive each monthly group of changes a month before production does. What configuration should the admin set?","zh":"請看圖。Admin 希望 sandbox 比 production 早一個月收到每月的那一包變更。應該怎麼設定？","zo":["Production 的 Jira 用 bundled track，sandbox 用 preview track","Production 的 Jira 用 preview track，sandbox 用 continuous track","兩邊都留在 continuous track，並在 production defer 變更"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 205\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Release tracks\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"203.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Atlassian Administration → Apps → Release management</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Release tracks</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Apps and sandboxes</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">acme・Jira</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Continuous</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"145\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">acme-dev・Jira sandbox</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Continuous</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"155\" width=\"106.0\" height=\"26\" rx=\"6\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><text x=\"65.0\" y=\"172\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"w\">Change track</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"203.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["Production Jira on the bundled track and the sandbox on the preview track","Production Jira on the preview track and the sandbox on the continuous track","Keep both on the continuous track and defer changes in production"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方推薦 production 用 Bundled、sandbox 用 Preview：Preview 和 Bundled 收到同一包變更，但 sandbox 會早一個月拿到，可以先測試再上 production。","B":"錯。Preview track 只給 sandbox，production 的 app 不能選；而 sandbox 用 Continuous，就得自己追每個變更的推出時程。","C":"錯。兩邊都用 Continuous 時，在 production defer 的變更也會自動延後到 sandbox，就沒辦法提前測那個變更。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/test-upcoming-changes-in-a-sandbox/","https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/what-are-release-tracks/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.2.2-e16","sec":"520.2.2","dom":"520.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An organization has Jira on an Enterprise plan on the continuous track. A newly announced change in App updates would disrupt a project launch. What must the admin do before the change can be deferred?","zh":"某 organization 的 Jira 是 Enterprise 方案、在 continuous track 上。App updates 剛公告的一個變更會影響專案上線。要 defer 這個變更之前，admin 必須先做什麼？","zo":["把 Jira sandbox 加進 freeze window","在 App updates 頁允許 org admin defer 變更","把 Jira 切到 bundled track，讓這個變更等下一包"],"fig":"","opts":["Add the Jira sandbox to a freeze window","Allow organization admins to defer changes on the App updates page","Switch Jira to the bundled track so the change waits for the next bundle"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Freeze window 可以包含 bundled 或 continuous track 上的 app，但不能包含 sandbox；而且它擋的是一段期間，不是單一變更。","B":"對。要 defer 某個變更，得先在 Apps → Release management → App updates 允許 org admin defer；之後在公告後 10 天內選該變更的 release note 按 Defer rollout，至少延後 30 天。","C":"錯。切到 bundled track 是讓大部分變更每月一起來，不是延後特定變更；而且已公告的變更不一定屬於 bundle 會延後的類型。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/defer-atlassian-changes-rolling-out-to-your-products/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.2.2-e17","sec":"520.2.2","dom":"520.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An Enterprise customer schedules a freeze window to protect the tax-filing season. Which statement about the freeze window is correct?","zh":"一個 Enterprise 客戶排了 freeze window，保護報稅季。關於 freeze window，哪個敘述正確？","zo":["可以把 sandbox 放進去，讓它和 production 保持一致","可以在 freeze 要開始的同一天才建立","Bug fix 與安全更新在 freeze window 期間仍會推出"],"fig":"","opts":["Sandboxes can be included so they stay aligned with production","It can be created on the same day the freeze is meant to start","Bug fixes and security updates still roll out during the freeze window"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Freeze window 只能包含 bundled 或 continuous track 上的 app，不能包含 sandbox；sandbox 會依自己的 release track 照常收到變更。","B":"錯。Freeze window 最多可在 60 天前建立，但不能在開始時間前 48 小時內建立，所以當天才建來不及。","C":"對。Freeze window 只擋可見變更、已 defer 的變更與 bundled 那一包；bug fix、安全與效能更新、長期大型變更在期間內照常推出。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/block-visible-changes-for-a-period-of-time/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.2.2-e18","sec":"520.2.2","dom":"520.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team on Jira Standard wants a sandbox to test workflow changes before applying them in production. What should the admin tell them?","zh":"一個使用 Jira Standard 的團隊，想在套用到 production 前先用 sandbox 測試 workflow 變更。Admin 應該怎麼回答？","zo":["Sandbox 要 Premium 或 Enterprise；Premium 試用可以暫時使用","Standard 每個 app 附一個免費 sandbox","Standard 可以不換方案直接加購 sandbox"],"fig":"","opts":["Sandboxes require Premium or Enterprise; a Premium trial gives temporary access","Standard includes one free sandbox per app","Standard can buy sandbox add-ons without changing plans"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。Sandbox 只給 Premium 或 Enterprise 方案的 app；Standard 方案沒有 sandbox，但可以用 30 天的 Premium 免費試用暫時使用 sandbox 功能。","B":"錯。每個 app 一個免費 sandbox 是 Premium 方案的內容，Standard 方案沒有任何 sandbox。","C":"錯。加購 sandbox 是給已經有 sandbox 功能、而且是年約方案的 app；Standard 方案本身就不能用 sandbox。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/understand-billing-for-sandboxes/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.2.2-e19","sec":"520.2.2","dom":"520.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A company has Jira on an Enterprise plan with four production sites. How many free Jira sandboxes can it create?","zh":"一家公司的 Jira 是 Enterprise 方案，有四個 production site。它可以建立幾個免費的 Jira sandbox？","zo":["無限多個，因為是 Enterprise 方案","最多五個，可以分配到任何 production site","每個 production site 一個，共四個"],"fig":"","opts":["An unlimited number, because the plan is Enterprise","Up to five, which can be allocated to any of its production sites","One for each production site, four in total"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Enterprise 的免費 sandbox 有上限（每個 app 五個）；超過的要另外加購 add-on。","B":"對。Enterprise 方案的每個 app 最多有五個免費 sandbox，可以分配到任何 production site，也能隨時重新分配；例如兩個給 Site 1、兩個給 Site 2、一個給 Site 3。","C":"錯。每個 app 一個免費 sandbox 是 Premium 的規則；Enterprise 不是按 site 數量計算，而是每個 app 最多五個。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/understand-billing-for-sandboxes/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.2.2-e20","sec":"520.2.2","dom":"520.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. The sandbox was created yesterday and production data was copied into it. QA testers report that they can't open the sandbox. What should the admin do?","zh":"請看圖。這個 sandbox 昨天建立，也已經複製了 production 的資料。QA 測試人員回報打不開 sandbox。Admin 應該怎麼做？","zo":["再複製一次 production 資料，這次包含附件","把 sandbox 切到 preview release track","用 Manage users 把測試人員加進對應的 sandbox group"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 205\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Sandboxes\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"203.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Atlassian Administration → Apps → Sandboxes</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Sandboxes</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Sandbox site: acme-uat</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"100\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-green\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Jira</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Online</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"145\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Last data copy</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Yesterday</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"155\" width=\"121.0\" height=\"26\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"72.5\" y=\"172\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\">Create sandbox</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"203.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["Copy production data again, this time including attachments","Switch the sandbox to the preview release track","Add the testers to the appropriate sandbox groups using Manage users"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。附件只影響複製的內容；而且 access settings 不會被複製，要把人加進 sandbox 的 group，權限才會生效。","B":"錯。Release track 控制 sandbox 何時收到 Atlassian 的變更，和誰能登入 sandbox 無關。","C":"對。Sandbox 剛建好時只有 org admin 能進；要讓其他人測試，到 Apps → Atlassian apps，在該 sandbox 的 More actions 選 Manage users，把人加進 sandbox 的 group。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/what-are-sandboxes/","https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/grant-access-to-a-sandbox/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.2.2-e21","sec":"520.2.2","dom":"520.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Jira sandbox wasn't used for several weeks and is now in the Offline state. Two weeks after it went offline, the team needs it again with its data. What should the admin do?","zh":"一個 Jira sandbox 好幾週沒用，現在是 Offline 狀態。變成 Offline 兩週後，團隊又需要它和裡面的資料。Admin 應該怎麼做？","zo":["在 Sandboxes 頁 Restore 這個 sandbox","建一個新的 sandbox，因為 offline 的 sandbox 救不回來","Reset 這個 sandbox，讓它回到 online"],"fig":"","opts":["Restore the sandbox from the Sandboxes page","Create a new sandbox, because offline sandboxes can't be recovered","Reset the sandbox to bring it back online"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。Offline 的 sandbox 在轉為 Offline 後 30 天內都能 Restore，資料會一起還原；兩週還在期限內。超過 30 天才會永久刪除。","B":"錯。Offline 不等於刪除，轉為 Offline 後 30 天內都可以連資料一起還原，不必重建 sandbox 再重新複製資料。","C":"錯。Reset 會永久刪除所有資料，而且只能對 Online 的 sandbox 做；它不是讓 offline sandbox 回來的方法。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/what-are-the-states-of-a-sandbox/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.2.2-e22","sec":"520.2.2","dom":"520.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Testers spent a week building test data in a Jira sandbox. Then the admin ran Copy production data again for the same sandbox. What happened to the testers' data?","zh":"測試人員花了一週在 Jira sandbox 建測試資料。之後 admin 對同一個 sandbox 又執行一次 Copy production data。測試人員的資料會怎樣？","zo":["保留下來，因為只會複製新的 project","被新複製的 production 資料覆蓋","和 production 的資料合併"],"fig":"","opts":["It was kept, because only new projects are copied","It was overwritten by the new copy of production data","It was merged with the production data"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。複製時會覆蓋 sandbox 的既有資料，不是只補上新的 project；選指定 project 也只是縮小複製範圍。","B":"對。每次從 production 複製資料到 sandbox，都會取代、也就是覆蓋 sandbox 裡現有的資料；要保留測試資料，就不要在測試期間重新複製。","C":"錯。官方用的字是 replace、overwrite，複製不會把 sandbox 的資料和 production 的資料合併。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/copy-production-data-to-sandbox/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.2.2-e23","sec":"520.2.2","dom":"520.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An admin built a new workflow and permission scheme in a sandbox, then created a deployment to production. The changes made in a team-managed project weren't deployed. Why?","zh":"Admin 在 sandbox 建了新的 workflow 與 permission scheme，再建立部署到 production。在 team-managed project 裡做的變更沒有被部署。為什麼？","zo":["Team-managed project 要先連同附件複製","只有 preview track 上的 sandbox 才能部署","部署只支援 company-managed project 的實體"],"fig":"","opts":["Team-managed projects must first be copied with attachments","Deployments only work from sandboxes on the preview track","Deployments support only company-managed project entities"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。附件屬於複製資料（production 到 sandbox）的選項，和部署設定（sandbox 到 production）支不支援 team-managed project 無關。","B":"錯。部署和 sandbox 在哪個 release track 無關；它是 Premium 與 Enterprise Jira 的 beta 功能，限制在支援的實體類型。","C":"對。從 sandbox 部署設定時，只支援 company-managed project 的實體（workflow、scheme、custom field 等）；team-managed project 的實體不支援，要在 production 手動調整。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/data-deployed-from-sandboxes/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.2.3-e24","sec":"520.2.3","dom":"520.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A company just upgraded Jira and Confluence from Free to Standard. The organization admin hasn't changed any Rovo settings. Who can use Rovo features in these apps?","zh":"一家公司剛把 Jira 與 Confluence 從 Free 升級到 Standard，org admin 還沒改任何 Rovo 設定。誰能在這些 app 使用 Rovo 功能？","zo":["沒有人，要等 admin 逐一替每個 app 啟用 Rovo","只有被指派 Rovo Standard user 角色的使用者","Organization 裡每個人，因為 Standard 方案自動啟用 Rovo"],"fig":"","opts":["No one until the admin activates Rovo for each app","Only users who are assigned the Rovo Standard user role","Everyone in the organization, because Rovo is enabled automatically on Standard plans"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。官方只對 sandbox 環境提到要手動啟用（而且 2025 年 4 月 14 日之後建立的 sandbox site 會自動啟用）；一般 Standard 以上的 app 已經自動啟用 Rovo，不必逐一開啟。","B":"錯。Rovo Standard user 角色是給沒有 Jira、Confluence 等付費訂閱的人用 Rovo；已有付費 app 的使用者不需要這個角色。","C":"對。Rovo 在 Standard、Premium、Enterprise 方案的 app 上自動啟用，organization 裡每個人都能用；admin 要做的是在 Rovo → Rovo access 封鎖不想開放的 app。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/what-is-atlassian-intelligence/","https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/manage-rovo-access/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.2.3-e25","sec":"520.2.3","dom":"520.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Legal asks that Rovo features be turned off in Jira Service Management, while Jira and Confluence keep Rovo. The organization is on a Premium plan. What should the admin do?","zh":"法務要求在 Jira Service Management 關閉 Rovo 功能，Jira 與 Confluence 則保留 Rovo。Organization 是 Premium 方案。Admin 應該怎麼做？","zo":["在 Rovo → Rovo access 加入 Jira Service Management 並選 Block access","把 Rovo 加進一個排除 Jira Service Management 的 IP allowlist","把所有 agent 從 Jira Service Management 的 default group 移除"],"fig":"","opts":["In Rovo, then Rovo access, add Jira Service Management and select Block access","Add Rovo to an IP allowlist that excludes Jira Service Management","Remove all agents from the Jira Service Management default group"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。Org admin 在 Atlassian Administration 的 Rovo → Rovo access 按 Add app，選要關閉的 app 再按 Block access；被封鎖的 app 現在與之後的 AI 功能都會關閉。","B":"錯。IP allowlist 控制的是從哪些 IP 位址能存取，不是用來替某個 app 關閉 Rovo 功能。","C":"錯。移除 default group 會讓 agent 失去 JSM 的存取，完全無法工作；要關的只是 Rovo 功能，應該用 Rovo access 封鎖 app。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/manage-rovo-access/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.2.3-e26","sec":"520.2.3","dom":"520.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"After an admin blocks Rovo for Confluence, a manager asks what happens to page summaries that Rovo generated last month. What is the correct answer?","zh":"Admin 封鎖 Confluence 的 Rovo 後，一位主管問：上個月 Rovo 產生的頁面摘要會怎樣？正確答案是？","zo":["被隱藏，直到 Confluence 的 Rovo 解除封鎖","會保留，Rovo 之前產生的內容不會被移除","封鎖 app 後 30 天內被刪除"],"fig":"","opts":["They're hidden until Rovo is unblocked for Confluence","They remain; content previously generated by Rovo isn't removed","They're deleted within 30 days of blocking the app"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。官方說之前產生的內容會保留，並沒有說會隱藏到解除封鎖為止。","B":"對。封鎖 app 會關掉該 app 現在與之後的 AI 功能，包含 Agents 與 Chat；但之前由 Rovo 產生的內容會保留，不會被刪除或隱藏。","C":"錯。30 天內刪除是指中斷第三方 connector 後刪除已索引的內容；封鎖 app 不會刪除 Rovo 產生過的內容。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/manage-rovo-access/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.2.3-e27","sec":"520.2.3","dom":"520.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Users of Jira on the acme site still see Rovo Search and Chat after Jira was blocked. What explains this?","zh":"請看圖。acme site 上的 Jira 已被封鎖，但 Jira 使用者仍看得到 Rovo Search 與 Chat。原因是什麼？","zo":["封鎖 app 最多要 30 天才生效","Search 與 Chat 只在 Rovo settings 的 Web search 分頁控制","只要 site 上還有 Jira app 啟用 Rovo，Jira 家族共用的功能就還在"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 165\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Rovo access\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"163.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Atlassian Administration → Rovo → Rovo access</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Rovo access</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Blocked apps</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"100\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Jira・acme</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Blocked</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"140\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s tf-violet\" style=\"font-weight:700\">acme also hosts Jira Service Management (not blocked)</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"163.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["Blocking an app takes up to 30 days to take effect","Search and Chat are controlled only on the Web search tab of Rovo settings","Shared Jira family features stay available while any Jira app on the site has Rovo enabled"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。官方沒有封鎖要 30 天才生效的說法；這裡的原因是同 site 的 JSM 仍啟用 Rovo。","B":"錯。Web search 只控制 Rovo 能不能把來源擴大到公開網站，不是開關 Search 與 Chat 的地方。","C":"對。封鎖一個 Jira 家族 app 只關那個 app 的 Rovo；Search、Chat、Create with Rovo 這些共用功能，只要同 site 還有 Jira app 啟用 Rovo 就還在，要全關就封鎖所有 Jira app。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/manage-rovo-access/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.2.3-e28","sec":"520.2.3","dom":"520.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An Enterprise organization uses the new Rovo access experience with default access disabled. Confluence is on the app allowlist, but users in the marketing group still can't use Rovo in Confluence. What should the admin do?","zh":"一個 Enterprise organization 使用新的 Rovo access 介面，default access 是關閉的。Confluence 已在 app allowlist，但 marketing group 的使用者仍不能在 Confluence 用 Rovo。Admin 應該怎麼做？","zo":["把 marketing group 加進 group allowlist","在 Rovo settings 開啟 web search","把 Rovo Standard user 角色指派給 marketing group"],"fig":"","opts":["Add the marketing group to the group allowlist","Turn on web search in Rovo settings","Assign the Rovo Standard user role to the marketing group"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。Default access 關閉時，app 與使用者的 group 都要加進 allowlist；只加 app、沒加 group，使用者仍然不能用。把 marketing group 加進 allowlist 就能在 Confluence 用 Rovo。","B":"錯。Web search 只決定 Rovo 能否使用公開網站當來源，和使用者有沒有 Rovo 存取無關。","C":"錯。Rovo Standard user 角色是讓沒有付費 app 訂閱的人用 Rovo；在 Enterprise 的 allowlist 模式下，要做的是把 group 加進 allowlist。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/manage-rovo-access-for-enterprise/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.2.3-e29","sec":"520.2.3","dom":"520.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Sam is in the contractors group and opens Confluence on the acme site. Can Sam use Rovo there?","zh":"請看圖。Sam 在 contractors group，他打開 acme site 上的 Confluence。Sam 能在那裡用 Rovo 嗎？","zo":["可以，但只有 Rovo Search，因為 group 封鎖只套用到 agent","不能，因為 app 或使用者的 group 任一個被封鎖，存取就會受限","可以，因為 Confluence 是允許的，app 設定優先於 group"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 197\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Rovo access\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"195.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Atlassian Administration → Rovo → Rovo access</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Rovo access</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"78\" width=\"34\" height=\"18\" rx=\"9\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><circle cx=\"37\" cy=\"87\" r=\"6.5\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><text x=\"54\" y=\"91\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Default access: Enabled</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"119\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Rules</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"130\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-green\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"149\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"149\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"141\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">App: Confluence・acme</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"141\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Allowed</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"156\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"175\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"175\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"167\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Group: contractors</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"167\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Blocked</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"195.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["Yes, but only Rovo Search, because group blocks apply only to agents","No, because access is restricted when either the app or the user's group is blocked","Yes, because Confluence is allowed and app settings take priority over groups"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。封鎖 group 會關掉該 group 現在與之後的所有 AI 功能，包含 Agents 與 Chat，不是只擋 agent。","B":"對。Default access 開啟時，只要 app 或使用者的 group 任一個被封鎖，存取就會受限；Sam 的 contractors group 被封鎖，所以在允許的 Confluence 裡也不能用 Rovo。","C":"錯。官方舉的例子正好相反：使用者在被封鎖的 app 裡不能用；同理，group 被封鎖時，app 允許也不能用，沒有 app 優先的規則。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/manage-rovo-access-for-enterprise/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.2.3-e30","sec":"520.2.3","dom":"520.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An HR director worries that employees could use Rovo Chat to summarize HR pages they aren't allowed to view. What should the admin explain?","zh":"一位 HR 主管擔心員工能用 Rovo Chat 摘要他們無權查看的 HR 頁面。Admin 應該怎麼說明？","zo":["必須在 Rovo access 封鎖 Confluence，才能保護受限頁面","必須開啟 Atlassian-hosted LLMs，Rovo 才會檢查頁面限制","Rovo 遵守 app 權限，使用者不能用自己沒有存取權的資源產生內容"],"fig":"","opts":["Confluence must be blocked in Rovo access to protect restricted pages","Atlassian-hosted LLMs must be enabled so Rovo checks page restrictions","Rovo honors app permissions, so users can't generate content from resources they can't access"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。封鎖 Confluence 會讓所有人失去 Confluence 的 Rovo 功能；權限本來就會被遵守，不必為了保護受限頁面而整個封鎖。","B":"錯。Atlassian-hosted LLMs 決定資料是否離開 Atlassian Cloud 邊界做 LLM 處理，和 Rovo 是否遵守頁面權限無關。","C":"對。Rovo 與 AI 遵守各 app 已設定的權限，使用者不能用自己沒有存取權的資源來產生內容；HR 頁面的限制會繼續生效。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/what-is-atlassian-intelligence/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.2.3-e31","sec":"520.2.3","dom":"520.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A site hosts Jira and Confluence. The admin plans to leave Rovo enabled only for Jira and block it for Confluence, assuming Rovo will then never use Confluence data. What should the admin understand?","zh":"某個 site 上有 Jira 與 Confluence。Admin 打算只讓 Jira 保留 Rovo、封鎖 Confluence，並認為這樣 Rovo 就永遠不會用到 Confluence 的資料。Admin 應該了解什麼？","zo":["只要 site 上有任一 app 啟用 AI，Rovo 就能存取並使用該 site 上所有 app 的資料","Rovo 只讀取有啟用它的 app 的資料","只有 Confluence 是 Enterprise 方案時才會使用它的資料"],"fig":"","opts":["If AI is activated for any app on a site, Rovo can access and use data from any app on that site","Rovo reads only the data of apps where it's enabled","Confluence data is used only if Confluence is on an Enterprise plan"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方提醒：只要某個 site 有任一 app 啟用 AI，Rovo 與其他 AI 功能就能存取並使用該 site 上所有 app 的資料；admin 應該依隱私需求檢視資料敏感的環境。","B":"錯。這正是官方特別提醒的誤解；啟用範圍以 site 為單位影響資料存取，不是只讀啟用 Rovo 的那個 app。","C":"錯。資料能否被 Rovo 使用與 Confluence 的方案無關，關鍵是同一個 site 上是否有任一 app 啟用 AI。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/manage-rovo-access/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.2.3-e32","sec":"520.2.3","dom":"520.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Employees want Rovo Chat to answer questions using public websites in addition to company knowledge. Where does the organization admin enable this?","zh":"員工希望 Rovo Chat 除了公司知識外，也能用公開網站回答問題。Org admin 要在哪裡開啟？","zo":["替每個公開網站建一個 Teamwork Graph custom website connector","Rovo → Rovo settings → Web search 分頁","Rovo → Rovo access → Add app"],"fig":"","opts":["A Teamwork Graph custom website connector for each public site","Rovo, then Rovo settings, then the Web search tab","Rovo, then Rovo access, then Add app"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Teamwork Graph connector 是把特定第三方 app 或網站接進 Rovo；要讓使用者用整個公開網路當來源，用的是 Web search 設定。","B":"對。在 Rovo → Rovo settings 的 Web search 分頁打開開關後，使用者可以把 Rovo 的來源切換或擴大到公開網站；Rovo Chat 與 Studio 的 agent 設定會出現對應開關。","C":"錯。Rovo access 的 Add app 是用來封鎖（或在 Enterprise 允許）某個 app 的 Rovo 功能，不控制 Rovo 能否搜尋公開網站。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/manage-a-web-search-option-for-rovo/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.2.3-e33","sec":"520.2.3","dom":"520.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. An admin created this Search bookmark. Who will see the bookmark when they search for salary bands?","zh":"請看圖。Admin 建了這個 Search bookmark。有人搜尋 salary bands 時，誰會看到這個 bookmark？","zo":["只有 HR group 的成員，因為 Rovo 會檢查頁面的限制","只有 org admin，因為 bookmark 只給 admin 看","所有搜尋這個字詞的人，因為 Rovo 不檢查目的連結的權限"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 224\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Add a new bookmark\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"222.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Atlassian Administration → Rovo → Rovo settings</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Add a new bookmark</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Search result title</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"95\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Salary bands 2026</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"144\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Search terms</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"150\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"168\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">salary bands</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"199\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s tf-violet\" style=\"font-weight:700\">Destination page is restricted to the HR group</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"222.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["Only members of the HR group, because Rovo checks the page's restrictions","Only organization admins, because bookmarks are admin-only","Everyone who searches for the term, because Rovo doesn't check the destination link's permissions"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。官方明說 Rovo 不檢查 bookmark 目的連結的權限，所以不會只對 HR group 顯示。","B":"錯。只有 admin 能新增與管理 bookmark，但 bookmark 本身是顯示給所有搜尋該字詞的人看的。","C":"對。Rovo 在顯示 bookmark 前不會檢查目的連結的權限，bookmark 會顯示給所有搜尋該字詞的人；點進去後，沒有權限的人仍打不開受限頁面。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/add-or-edit-rovo-search-bookmarks/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.2.3-e34","sec":"520.2.3","dom":"520.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An organization that had the previous Studio experience now uses the new standalone Studio app. The organization admin had restricted agent creation in Jira, but a Jira app admin can still create agents in Studio. Why?","zh":"某 organization 原本有舊版 Studio，現在改用獨立的新版 Studio app。Org admin 先前限制了 Jira 裡的 agent 建立權限，但一位 Jira app admin 仍能在 Studio 建 agent。為什麼？","zo":["Studio 的 app admin 有完整建立權限，不受其他 product 的限制影響","Agent 建立限制要 48 到 72 小時才會同步到 Studio","這位 Jira app admin 也有 Rovo Standard user 角色"],"fig":"","opts":["Studio app admins have full creation permissions, regardless of restrictions in other products","Agent creation restrictions take 48 to 72 hours to reach Studio","The Jira app admin also has the Rovo Standard user role"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。原本就有舊版 Studio 的 organization，Jira、Confluence、JSM 的 app admin 會自動成為 Studio 的 app admin；Studio app admin 有完整建立權限，在其他 product 被限制也照樣能建 agent，要到 Studio settings 限制。","B":"錯。48 到 72 小時是 Rovo trends 數據的更新頻率，和建立權限何時生效無關。","C":"錯。Rovo Standard user 角色只是讓沒有付費訂閱的人使用 Rovo，不會給人建立 agent 的管理權限。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/use-rovo-studio-in-your-organization/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.2.3-e35","sec":"520.2.3","dom":"520.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Several contractors use only Slack and Microsoft tools and have no paid Atlassian app subscription, but they need Rovo. The organization has upgraded to Rovo Standard. What should the admin do?","zh":"幾位外包人員只用 Slack 與 Microsoft 工具，沒有任何付費的 Atlassian app 訂閱，但需要用 Rovo。Organization 已升級到 Rovo Standard。Admin 應該怎麼做？","zo":["不給任何角色，直接把他們加進 Rovo access 的 allowlist","在每個需要 Rovo 的 site 上，指派 Rovo Standard user 角色給他們","指派 Rovo Standard user access admin 角色給他們"],"fig":"","opts":["Add them to the Rovo access allowlist without any role","Assign them the Rovo Standard user role on each site where they need Rovo","Assign them the Rovo Standard user access admin role"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Allowlist 是 Enterprise 用來控制哪些 app 與 group 能用 Rovo；它不會替沒有任何 Rovo 存取的人產生授權。","B":"對。Rovo Standard 讓沒有付費 Atlassian app 訂閱的人也能用 Rovo；要在每個需要的 site 上指派 Rovo Standard user 角色，可以直接給、透過 group，或邀請時給。","C":"錯。Rovo Standard user access admin 只能替別人指派 Rovo Standard 的存取；access admin 類角色不會自動給自己 app 存取，要用 Rovo 得有 Rovo Standard user 角色。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/manage-rovo-standard-access/","https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/what-are-the-different-types-of-admin-roles/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.2.3-e36","sec":"520.2.3","dom":"520.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A bank on Atlassian Cloud Enterprise must ensure that no customer data leaves Atlassian's cloud boundary for LLM processing when using Rovo. What should the organization admin do?","zh":"一家使用 Atlassian Cloud Enterprise 的銀行，必須確保使用 Rovo 時，客戶資料不會離開 Atlassian 的雲端邊界做 LLM 處理。Org admin 應該怎麼做？","zo":["在 Rovo settings 替每個 site 打開 Atlassian-hosted LLMs 開關","在 Rovo access 封鎖所有 app，再只重新啟用 Confluence","向 Atlassian account team 或 support 申請 Atlassian-hosted LLMs"],"fig":"","opts":["Turn on the Atlassian-hosted LLMs toggle for each site in Rovo settings","Block every app in Rovo access, then re-enable only Confluence","Request Atlassian-hosted LLMs through the Atlassian account team or support"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。這個選項套用在整個 organization，不是逐個 site 設定；而且 Atlassian Administration 目前還沒有自助開關。","B":"錯。封鎖或重新啟用 app 只決定哪些 app 有 Rovo，無法改變 Rovo 使用哪些 LLM，資料仍可能送到外部 LLM 供應商。","C":"對。Atlassian-hosted LLMs 是 Enterprise 的 organization 層級選項，開啟後 Rovo 只用 Atlassian Cloud 邊界內的 LLM；目前沒有自助開關，要向 account team 或 support 申請。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/atlassian-hosted-llms/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.2.3-e37","sec":"520.2.3","dom":"520.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Leadership wants a monthly report of how many people actively use Rovo and how many Rovo credits were consumed. Which pages should the admin use?","zh":"主管想要每月報告：有多少人實際在用 Rovo、用了多少 Rovo credit。Admin 應該看哪些頁面？","zo":["採用情況看 Rovo trends；credit 用量看 Insights → Platform usage","採用情況與精確的 credit 用量都看 Rovo trends","採用情況與 credit 都看 organization 的 audit log"],"fig":"","opts":["Rovo trends for adoption, and Insights, then Platform usage for credit consumption","Rovo trends for both adoption and exact credit consumption","The organization audit log for both adoption and credits"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。Rovo trends 的 Adoption 分頁有 Active users 等採用指標；但它可能包含不算 credit 的 AI 功能，準確的 credit 用量要看 Insights → Platform usage。","B":"錯。官方說 Rovo trends 和 Platform usage 的數字會有差異，Rovo trends 不是 credit 用量的準確來源。","C":"錯。Audit log 記錄 organization 裡的管理活動，不提供 Rovo 的採用趨勢或 credit 用量。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/gain-insights-into-rovo-ai-activity/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.3.1-e01","sec":"520.3.1","dom":"520.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Acme wants every employee with an acme.com email address to start using Jira without waiting for an invitation or an admin approval. People from other domains must not be able to join this way. What should the organization admin configure?","zh":"Acme 希望所有 acme.com 的員工不必等邀請或核准就能開始用 Jira，其他網域的人不能用這種方式加入。Org admin 應該設定什麼？","zo":["打開 Jira 的 invitation link，寄給所有員工","把 acme.com 加為 approved domain，給 Jira 角色並取消 Required","把 Jira 的 user invites 設成 Invite anyone"],"fig":"","opts":["Turn on a Jira invitation link and email it to all employees","Add acme.com as an approved domain with a Jira role and clear the Required checkbox","Set the Jira user invites permission to Invite anyone"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Invitation link 是拿到連結的任何人都能加入，不會檢查 email 網域；外流時其他網域的人也進得來，而且 30 天就失效。","B":"對。Approved domains 讓指定網域的人不用邀請就能加入；Required 不勾時，這個網域的人會即時加入，不需要 admin 核准。其他網域不受這一列影響。","C":"錯。User invites 的 Invite anyone 是讓「現有使用者」邀請任何網域的人；新員工仍要等同事邀請，也沒有限制只有 acme.com。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/control-how-users-get-access-to-products/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.3.1-e02","sec":"520.3.1","dom":"520.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. A new employee signs up for an Atlassian account with an acme.com address and opens the Jira site. What happens next?","zh":"請看圖。一位新員工用 acme.com 的 email 建立 Atlassian account 後打開 Jira 站台，接下來會怎樣？","zo":["他立刻加入 Jira，成為計費使用者","因為 acme.com 不是公開網域，他不能申請存取","他送出存取申請，要 admin 核准後才能用 Jira"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 211\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"App access settings\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"209.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 H106 V210.25 H10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 -10,-10 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><line x1=\"106\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"106\" y2=\"211\" class=\"gl\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Atlassian Administration → Apps → App access settings</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">App access settings</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Approved domains</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"100\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">acme.com</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Jira：User</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"140\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Required</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"146\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><path d=\"M121,153 l3,3 l5,-6\" class=\"ln\" style=\"stroke:var(--on-color);stroke-width:2\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"157\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Approve requests for access</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"186\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s tf-violet\" style=\"font-weight:700\">Notify org admins: daily digest</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Overview</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Directory</text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"91\" width=\"94\" height=\"22\" rx=\"6\" class=\"sf-brand\"/><text x=\"14\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Apps</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Security</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"158\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Billing</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"209.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["They join Jira instantly and become a licensed user","They can't request access because acme.com is not a public domain","They submit a request for access that an admin must approve before they can use Jira"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。即時加入是 Required 沒有勾選時的行為；圖中這一列勾了 Required，所以要先經過核准。","B":"錯。acme.com 已被列為 approved domain，正是允許這個網域的人取得存取；公開或私有網域只影響沒被核准時套用的 Any domain 設定。","C":"對。這個 approved domain 勾了 Required，代表要核准申請；acme.com 的人會送出存取申請，admin 核准後才拿到 Jira 的 User 角色。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/control-how-users-get-access-to-products/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.3.1-e03","sec":"520.3.1","dom":"520.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A company provisions all application access through its ITSM tool. Admins want to stop Jira users from inviting colleagues and from requesting access from inside Jira. Which user invites option should they choose?","zh":"公司所有 app 存取都走 ITSM 工具申請。Admin 想讓 Jira 使用者不能邀請同事、也不能在 Jira 內申請存取，User invites 應該選哪一個？","zo":["Don't allow invites","Require admin approval","Invite approved domains"],"fig":"","opts":["Don't allow invites","Require admin approval","Invite approved domains"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。Don't allow invites 是最封閉的選項：使用者不能邀請，也不能申請存取，適合公司已有 ITSM 或 helpdesk 申請流程的情況；org admin 仍可邀請。","B":"錯。Require admin approval 雖然不讓使用者直接邀請，但仍允許他們替自己或替別人送出存取申請，和「不要在 Jira 內申請」的需求不符。","C":"錯。Invite approved domains 允許使用者直接邀請 approved domain 的人，而且不需要 admin 核准，是比較開放的選項。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/control-how-users-get-access-to-products/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.3.1-e04","sec":"520.3.1","dom":"520.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"The Confluence user invites permission is set to Require admin approval. What can an existing Confluence user do when a teammate needs access?","zh":"Confluence 的 user invites 設為 Require admin approval。同事需要存取時，現有的 Confluence 使用者能做什麼？","zo":["什麼都不能做，只有 admin 能啟動任何存取流程","替同事申請存取，再由 org admin 核准或拒絕","如果同事用的是 approved domain，就直接邀請"],"fig":"","opts":["Nothing; only admins can start any kind of access process","Request access on the teammate's behalf; an organization admin then approves or denies it","Invite the teammate directly if the teammate uses an approved domain"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。連申請都不能送，是 Don't allow invites 的效果；Require admin approval 仍保留使用者送出申請的管道。","B":"對。Require admin approval 下使用者不能直接邀請，但可以替自己或替別人申請存取；申請會由 org admin 核准。適合想控制存取、但公司沒有正式申請流程的情況。","C":"錯。不經核准直接邀請 approved domain 的人，是 Invite approved domains 這個選項的行為；Require admin approval 一律不能直接邀請。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/control-how-users-get-access-to-products/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.3.1-e05","sec":"520.3.1","dom":"520.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An organization uses the centralized user management experience and sets every app's user invites option to Don't allow invites. Who can still invite new users to Jira?","zh":"某 organization 使用 centralized user management，所有 app 的 user invites 都設成 Don't allow invites。誰仍然可以邀請新使用者進 Jira？","zo":["Jira 的 app admin（jira-admins-{site} 成員）","改設定之前沒有人可以","Org admin 與 Jira 的 user access admin"],"fig":"","opts":["Jira app admins (members of jira-admins-{site})","No one until the setting is changed","Organization admins and the Jira user access admins"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。App admin 管的是 Jira 內的設定，不能進 Atlassian Administration 管使用者；邀請權不會因為是 Jira admin 而保留。","B":"錯。User invites 只管「現有使用者」能不能邀請，不會鎖住 admin；org admin 永遠可以從 Directory 邀請。","C":"對。官方寫明選 Don't allow invites 後，org admin 與 user access admin（centralized 介面）仍然可以邀請使用者；這個設定只限制一般使用者。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/control-how-users-get-access-to-products/","https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/what-are-the-different-types-of-admin-roles/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.3.1-e06","sec":"520.3.1","dom":"520.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An admin wants to onboard a group of external consultants into Confluence quickly and is considering an invitation link. Which statement about invitation links is correct?","zh":"Admin 想讓一群外部顧問快速進 Confluence，正考慮用 invitation link。關於 invitation link，哪一項正確？","zo":["拿到連結的人都能加入；連結 30 天後失效，也可隨時關閉或重新產生","連結只對 approved domain 的 email 有效","每個用連結的人都要 org admin 核准"],"fig":"","opts":["Anyone with the link can join the app; the link expires after 30 days and can be turned off or regenerated at any time","The link only works for email addresses from approved domains","Each person who uses the link must be approved by an organization admin"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。Invitation link 讓拿到連結的任何人加入所選的 app，所以只分享給信任的人；它 30 天後自動失效，也可以隨時關掉 toggle 或重新產生。","B":"錯。限制網域的是 approved domains 或 Invite approved domains；invitation link 不檢查 email 網域，這也是它要小心分享的原因。","C":"錯。Invitation link 的用途就是快速加入、不必逐一核准；需要核准的是 Required 勾選或 Require admin approval 這類設定。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/control-how-users-get-access-to-products/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.3.1-e07","sec":"520.3.1","dom":"520.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A user with an email address from a private company domain that the organization has not approved tries to access Jira. Which setting determines whether they can join or request access?","zh":"一位使用者的 email 來自 organization 沒有核准的私有公司網域，他嘗試存取 Jira。哪個設定決定他能不能加入或申請？","zo":["Jira 的 user invites 權限","App access settings 中的 Any domain 設定","Jira 的 invitation link 開關"],"fig":"","opts":["The Jira user invites permission","The Any domain setting in App access settings","The Jira invitation link toggle"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。User invites 決定現有使用者能不能邀請別人，與一個尚未加入的人自己申請存取無關。","B":"對。沒被核准的私有網域都套用 App access settings 裡的「Any domain」那一列；預設允許公開與私有網域的人申請，也可以改成即時加入或要求核准。","C":"錯。Invitation link 只決定「拿到連結的人」能不能加入；這位使用者沒有連結，是自己打開 Jira，所以不適用。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/control-how-users-get-access-to-products/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.3.1-e08","sec":"520.3.1","dom":"520.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Which user management experience does this organization use?","zh":"請看圖。這個 organization 使用哪一種 user management experience？","zo":["Original，因為使用者依 site 分開管理","要先查有沒有 Atlassian Guard 才能判斷","Centralized，因為 Users 與 Groups 在 Directory 底下"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 202\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Directory\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"200.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 H106 V201.25 H10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 -10,-10 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><line x1=\"106\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"106\" y2=\"202\" class=\"gl\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Atlassian Administration → Directory</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Directory</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"83\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"102\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"102\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"94\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Users</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"94\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"109\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-teal\"/><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"128\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"128\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"120\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Groups</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"120\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"135\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-violet\"/><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"154\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"154\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"146\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Managed accounts</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"146\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"161\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"180\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"180\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"172\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Domains</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"172\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><text x=\"14\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Overview</text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"65\" width=\"94\" height=\"22\" rx=\"6\" class=\"sf-brand\"/><text x=\"14\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Directory</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Apps</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Security</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"158\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Billing</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"200.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["Original, because users are managed per site","It can't be determined without checking whether Atlassian Guard is active","Centralized, because Users and Groups are listed under Directory"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Original 介面的 Users 在 Apps → 某個 site 底下，每個 site 各自管理；圖中 Users 在 Directory，代表整個 organization 共用一份。","B":"錯。Atlassian Guard 是另外訂閱的安全功能，和是哪一種 user management experience 無關；看 Users 的位置就能判斷。","C":"對。官方的判斷方式是看 Users 頁的位置：Users 與 Groups 出現在 Directory 底下就是 centralized；original 的 Users 在 Apps 底下所選的 site 裡。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/invite-a-user/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.3.1-e09","sec":"520.3.1","dom":"520.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Users from an approved domain join Confluence without the Required checkbox selected. How does this affect the subscription?","zh":"Approved domain 的使用者在沒勾 Required 的情況下加入 Confluence。這對訂閱有什麼影響？","zo":["他們成為計費使用者，計入 user limit","他們以 guest 身分加入，不計費","要等 org admin 在 Billing 頁確認後才計費"],"fig":"","opts":["They become licensed users and count toward the user limit","They join as guests and don't count toward billing","They aren't billed until an org admin confirms them on the Billing page"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方寫明透過 app access settings 加入的人會成為 licensed users；超過 user limit 時 Atlassian 會寄 email 通知。所以取消 Required 前要先評估人數。","B":"錯。Guest 是 Confluence 另外的角色（confluence-guests），一次只能進一個 space；從 approved domain 拿到 User 角色的人是一般計費使用者。","C":"錯。計費不需要在 Billing 頁另外確認；使用者被加入 app 時就會計入，即使還沒登入也一樣。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/control-how-users-get-access-to-products/","https://support.atlassian.com/subscriptions-and-billing/docs/manage-users-and-user-tiers/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.3.1-e10","sec":"520.3.1","dom":"520.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"After an acquisition, a company has two Atlassian organizations, Org A and Org B. An admin invites a new hire in Org A and gives Jira access. What is true about Org B?","zh":"併購後公司有 Org A、Org B 兩個 Atlassian organization。Admin 在 Org A 邀請新人並給 Jira 存取，關於 Org B 哪一項正確？","zo":["在 Org A 驗證網域後，他會得到 Org B 的 default groups","他在 Org B 什麼都沒有，因為每個 organization 有各自的使用者與 app 存取","因為兩個 organization 屬於同一家公司，他會自動加入 Org B"],"fig":"","opts":["The new hire gets Org B's default groups once the email domain is verified in Org A","The new hire gets nothing in Org B, because each organization has its own user base and app access","The new hire is added to Org B automatically because both organizations belong to the same company"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。在 Org A 驗證網域只讓 Org A 能 claim 該網域的帳號成為 managed account，不會替他在 Org B 加入任何 group 或 app。","B":"對。每個 organization 各有一份使用者，包含 app 存取與 user provisioning 設定；只有同一個 organization 底下的 site 共用使用者。要用 Org B 的 app，得在 Org B 另外給存取。","C":"錯。Atlassian 不會因為「同一家公司」就跨 organization 同步使用者；兩個 organization 是分開的管理單位，要整合得走 consolidation。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/migration/docs/user-management-differences-in-cloud-and-server/","https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/invite-a-user/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.3.1-e11","sec":"520.3.1","dom":"520.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An admin invites a contractor's email address to the organization and gives Confluence access. Which statement about the contractor's Atlassian account is correct?","zh":"Admin 邀請一位承包商的 email 進 organization，並給 Confluence 存取。關於他的 Atlassian account，哪一項正確？","zo":["他接受邀請後帳號就變成 managed account","Organization 現在可以修改他的個人資料","Organization 並不擁有這個帳號，要驗證網域並 claim 才能管理"],"fig":"","opts":["The account becomes a managed account as soon as the invitation is accepted","The organization can now update the contractor's profile details","The organization doesn't own the account; it would need to verify the domain and claim the account to manage it"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。接受邀請只讓他成為你們 app 的使用者；managed account 的條件是網域已驗證而且帳號已被 claim，兩者缺一不可。","B":"錯。只有 managed account 的資料能由 org admin 修改；external user 的資料由本人在 id.atlassian.com 維護。","C":"對。邀請的是一個 email 地址；被邀請進來不代表 organization 擁有這個帳號。要管理帳號本身，得先驗證網域並 claim，才會成為 managed account。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/invite-a-user/","https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/what-are-managed-accounts/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.3.2-e12","sec":"520.3.2","dom":"520.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A colleague shares a Confluence page link with Priya, who has an Atlassian account but no Confluence access on that site. What happens when Priya opens the link?","zh":"同事把 Confluence 頁面連結分享給 Priya；她有 Atlassian account，但在這個站台沒有 Confluence 存取。她打開連結時會怎樣？","zo":["系統提示她申請 Confluence 存取","因為是計費使用者分享的，她自動取得存取","她先以唯讀模式看頁面，直到 admin 移除她"],"fig":"","opts":["She is prompted to request access to Confluence","She gets access automatically because the link was shared by a licensed user","She sees the page in read-only mode until an admin removes her"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。使用者打開沒有存取的 app 時，系統會提示他申請存取；常見的觸發點就是有存取的人分享了連結。申請送出後由 admin 核准或拒絕。","B":"錯。分享連結不會轉移存取權；有沒有 app 存取取決於 app 角色，不取決於誰分享了連結。","C":"錯。沒有 app 存取就看不到內容（除非 space 開放匿名存取）；不存在「先唯讀、之後再移除」的機制。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/approve-or-deny-product-access-requests/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.3.2-e13","sec":"520.3.2","dom":"520.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which requirement must a person meet before they can submit an app access request?","zh":"一個人必須符合哪個條件，才能送出 app 存取申請？","zo":["先被邀請進 organization","有 Atlassian account 且 email 已驗證","使用 approved domain 的 email"],"fig":"","opts":["Be invited to the organization first","Have an Atlassian account with a verified email address","Use an email address from an approved domain"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。已經被邀請的人就有存取了，不需要再申請；access request 正是給還沒被邀請的人用的管道。","B":"對。官方寫明申請者需要 Atlassian account 與已驗證的 email；而且只有 admin 核准後，他才能存取你們的 site 或 app。","C":"錯。Approved domain 是讓特定網域的人不用邀請就加入；申請存取並不要求一定來自 approved domain，沒核准的網域依 Any domain 設定也可能可以申請。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/approve-or-deny-product-access-requests/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.3.2-e14","sec":"520.3.2","dom":"520.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"In the centralized user management experience, where does an organization admin review pending access requests for all sites?","zh":"Centralized user management 中，org admin 要在哪裡審核所有 site 的待處理存取申請？","zo":["Directory > Users，篩選 Invited 狀態","Security > User security > External users","Apps > User requests > Access requests"],"fig":"","opts":["Directory > Users, filtered by Invited status","Security > User security > External users","Apps > User requests > Access requests"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Users 頁的 Invited 狀態是「已被邀請、尚未接受」的人，不是使用者自己送出的存取申請。","B":"錯。Security 底下管的是驗證政策、外部使用者安全等設定，不是審核存取申請的地方。","C":"對。Centralized 介面下，access requests 彙整 organization 內所有 site，位置是 Apps → User requests → Access requests；也可以從相關 email 直接核准或拒絕。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/approve-or-deny-product-access-requests/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.3.2-e15","sec":"520.3.2","dom":"520.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Kim is the user access admin for Jira in an organization that uses centralized user management. A request for Jira access is waiting. Who can approve it?","zh":"Kim 是某 organization（centralized）的 Jira user access admin。現在有一筆 Jira 存取申請待處理，誰能核准？","zo":["Org admin，或該 site 的 site admin","Kim，因為她管 Jira 的存取","該站台的任何 Jira app admin"],"fig":"","opts":["An organization admin, or a site admin for the site the request is for","Kim, because she manages access to Jira","Any Jira app admin on that site"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方列出能核准或拒絕的角色是 org admin，以及 site admin（只限自己管的 site）。User access admin 能給或收存取，但不在審核申請的名單上。","B":"錯。User access admin 管的是某個 app 的使用者存取，例如邀請、給角色；角色比較表中「核准存取申請」這一項 user access admin 不允許。","C":"錯。App admin 管 app 內的設定，不能進 Atlassian Administration，所以看不到 Access requests 清單。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/approve-or-deny-product-access-requests/","https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/what-are-the-different-types-of-admin-roles/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.3.2-e16","sec":"520.3.2","dom":"520.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An admin denies a user's request for Confluence access. What happens next?","zh":"Admin 拒絕了某使用者的 Confluence 存取申請。接下來會怎樣？","zo":["申請會移到 User interests 分頁，之後再審","使用者不能再申請；admin 可附上一段說明原因","30 天後使用者可以再送一次申請"],"fig":"","opts":["The request moves to the User interests tab for later review","The user can't request access again; the admin can include a short message explaining why","The user can submit a new request after 30 days"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。User interests 分頁用來追蹤使用者對新 app 的興趣趨勢，不是被拒絕申請的暫存區。","B":"對。被拒絕的人不能再申請存取，所以拒絕前要想清楚；拒絕時可以附上一段簡短說明。之後若要給他存取，只能由 admin 主動邀請或給角色。","C":"錯。官方沒有「30 天後可再申請」的機制；30 天是 invitation link 自動失效的時間，兩者不要混在一起。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/approve-or-deny-product-access-requests/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.3.2-e17","sec":"520.3.2","dom":"520.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Leo wants to ask for access for his new teammate Mia. For which app can Leo submit a request on Mia's behalf?","zh":"請看圖。Leo 想替新同事 Mia 申請存取。他可以替 Mia 申請哪一個 app？","zo":["Confluence","Organization 裡的任何 app","Jira"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 186\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Leo\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"184.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 H106 V185.25 H10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 -10,-10 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><line x1=\"106\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"106\" y2=\"186\" class=\"gl\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Atlassian Administration → Directory → Users</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Leo</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Apps</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"100\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Jira (acme)</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">User</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"126\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-gray\"/><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"145\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Confluence (acme)</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">No access</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Overview</text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"65\" width=\"94\" height=\"22\" rx=\"6\" class=\"sf-brand\"/><text x=\"14\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Directory</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Apps</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Security</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"158\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Billing</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"184.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["Confluence","Any app in the organization","Jira"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Leo 沒有 Confluence 存取；他只能替自己申請 Confluence，不能替別人申請自己沒有的 app。","B":"錯。替別人申請的範圍限於申請者自己已有的 app；能「替自己申請任何新 app」的是本人，不是替別人。","C":"對。已有至少一個 app 的使用者，可以替別人申請「自己已經有的那個 app」。圖中 Leo 只有 Jira，所以只能替 Mia 申請 Jira。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/approve-or-deny-product-access-requests/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.3.2-e18","sec":"520.3.2","dom":"520.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An admin approves a request for Jira access. The next day the user also has Confluence, and the bill shows one more Confluence user. What is the most likely cause?","zh":"Admin 核准了一筆 Jira 存取申請。隔天這位使用者也有 Confluence，帳單上 Confluence 使用者多了一位。最可能的原因？","zo":["Jira User 角色的 default group 也給了 Confluence 角色","核准申請會自動給站台上所有 app","使用者是從 User interests 分頁被加入的"],"fig":"","opts":["The default group for the Jira User role also grants a Confluence role","Approving a request automatically grants every app on the site","The user was added from the User interests tab"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。核准就是給 app 存取，系統會把他放進該角色的 default group；如果這個 default group 被設定成也給 Confluence，他會一起拿到 Confluence 並開始計費。","B":"錯。核准只給申請的那個 app 角色；會多出其他 app，是因為 default group 本身連帶了其他 app，不是核准動作本身的規則。","C":"錯。User interests 只是追蹤使用者對新 app 的興趣，不會替任何人加上存取或改變計費。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/give-users-access-to-products/","https://support.atlassian.com/subscriptions-and-billing/docs/manage-users-and-user-tiers/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.3.2-e19","sec":"520.3.2","dom":"520.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"In an organization with centralized user management, a site admin approved an access request. Later the user must lose access. What is true?","zh":"某 organization 使用 centralized user management。一位 site admin 核准了存取申請，之後這位使用者必須失去存取。哪一項正確？","zo":["Site admin 只能把他從自己管的 site 移除","Site admin 不能移除他，要由 org admin（或該 app 的 user access admin）處理","Site admin 可以移除，因為申請是他核准的"],"fig":"","opts":["The site admin can remove the user only from the site they administer","The site admin can't remove the user; an organization admin (or a user access admin for that app) must do it","The site admin can remove the user because they approved the request"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。「只限自己的 site」是 original 介面下 site admin 管理使用者的範圍；centralized 的 site admin 連自己的 site 也不能修改使用者。","B":"對。Centralized 介面下 site admin 可以核准存取申請，但不能邀請或修改任何使用者，所以核准後收不回來；要由 org admin，或該 app 的 user access admin 處理。","C":"錯。核准申請的權限和修改使用者的權限是分開的；centralized 的 site admin 沒有修改使用者的權限，核准過也一樣。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/atlassian-cloud/kb/site-administrator-role-in-the-centralized-user-management-and-original-user-management-experiences/","https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/remove-or-suspend-a-user/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.3.2-e20","sec":"520.3.2","dom":"520.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. An admin in this organization handles access requests from this page. What does the exhibit indicate about how requests are organized?","zh":"請看圖。這個 organization 的 admin 在這一頁處理存取申請。圖中顯示申請是怎麼組織的？","zo":["Admin 管的所有 organization 的申請合併在一張清單","因為是 centralized，所以申請列在 Directory 底下","依 site 分開審核，符合 original user management"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 294\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Access requests\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"292.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 H106 V293.25 H10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 -10,-10 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><line x1=\"106\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"106\" y2=\"294\" class=\"gl\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Atlassian Administration → Apps → acme</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Access requests</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Sites</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"95\" width=\"136.39999999999998\" height=\"20\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx brand\"/><text x=\"186.2\" y=\"109\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:11.5px\">acme.atlassian.net</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"121\" width=\"156.79999999999998\" height=\"20\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"196.39999999999998\" y=\"135\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:11.5px\">acme-eu.atlassian.net</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Pending</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"177\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"196\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"196\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"188\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">ana@other.io</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"188\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Jira</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"206\" width=\"121.0\" height=\"26\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"178.5\" y=\"223\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\">Review request</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"244\" width=\"98.5\" height=\"26\" rx=\"6\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><text x=\"167.25\" y=\"261\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"w\">Approve now</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Overview</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Directory</text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"91\" width=\"94\" height=\"22\" rx=\"6\" class=\"sf-brand\"/><text x=\"14\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Apps</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Security</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"158\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Billing</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"292.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["Requests from all organizations the admin manages are combined in one list","Requests are listed under Directory because the organization uses centralized user management","Requests are reviewed per site, which matches the original user management experience"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。每個 organization 是分開的管理單位；即使是 centralized，也只彙整「同一個 organization 內」所有 site 的申請，不會跨 organization。","B":"錯。兩種介面的 Access requests 都在 Apps 底下，不在 Directory；圖中先選 site，正好代表不是 centralized。","C":"對。圖中是從 Apps 的側欄先選 site，再進 Access requests，按鈕是 Review request 與 Approve now，這是 original 介面的路徑；centralized 則在 Apps → User requests 彙整所有 site。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/approve-or-deny-product-access-requests/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":1},{"id":"520.3.3-e21","sec":"520.3.3","dom":"520.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An employee is taking three months of parental leave. Their account is not a managed account. The admin wants to stop billing for them and restore exactly the same roles and groups when they return. What should the admin do?","zh":"員工請三個月育嬰假，他的帳號不是 managed account。Admin 想停止計費，回來時恢復完全相同的角色與 group，應該怎麼做？","zo":["暫停（suspend）存取，回來時再 restore","移除使用者，回來時重新邀請","停用（deactivate）帳號，回來時再重新啟用"],"fig":"","opts":["Suspend the user's access, then restore access when they return","Remove the user, then invite them again when they return","Deactivate the account, then reactivate it when they return"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。Suspend 暫停存取、期間不計費；Restore access 後角色與 group 成員資格原樣回來，最省事。任何使用者都能被 suspend，不需要是 managed account。","B":"錯。Remove 也會停止計費，但重新邀請時要重新指定角色與 group，達不到「原樣恢復」的需求。","C":"錯。Deactivate 只能用在 organization 擁有的 managed account；題目的帳號不是 managed，所以不能 deactivate。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/remove-or-suspend-a-user/","https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/deactivate-a-managed-account/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.3.3-e22","sec":"520.3.3","dom":"520.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An admin removed a user from the organization by mistake. What must the admin do to give the user the same access again?","zh":"Admin 不小心把一位使用者移出 organization。要讓他恢復相同的存取，admin 必須怎麼做？","zo":["14 天內在 Managed accounts 頁取消移除","重新邀請，並重新指定角色與 group","在使用者的 ••• 選單選 Restore access"],"fig":"","opts":["Cancel the removal within 14 days from the Managed accounts page","Invite the user again and reassign their roles and group memberships","Select Restore access from the user's more actions menu"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。14 天內取消的是 managed account 的刪除（delete account）；remove user 不會刪帳號，也沒有取消的按鈕。","B":"對。Remove user 後，要重新邀請他進 organization，並重新指定角色與 group 成員資格。能自動恢復角色與 group 的是 suspend 之後的 restore。","C":"錯。Restore access 用在被 suspend 的使用者；被 remove 的人已經不在 Users 清單，沒有可以 restore 的狀態。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/remove-or-suspend-a-user/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.3.3-e23","sec":"520.3.3","dom":"520.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A consultant has access to apps in your organization and in a partner's organization. You remove the consultant from your organization. What happens to the consultant's access in the partner's organization?","zh":"顧問同時有你們 organization 與合作夥伴 organization 的 app 存取。你把他移出你們的 organization，他在合作夥伴那邊的存取會怎樣？","zo":["帳號 14 天後被刪除，所以他在所有地方都失去存取","他在合作夥伴的 organization 會被暫停，直到對方 admin 還原","不變；移除使用者不影響其他 organization，也不刪帳號"],"fig":"","opts":["The consultant loses access everywhere because the Atlassian account is deleted after 14 days","The consultant is suspended in the partner's organization until its admin restores them","Nothing changes; removing a user doesn't affect other organizations or delete the account"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。14 天寬限期後永久刪除，是刪除帳號（delete account）的流程；remove user 不刪帳號。","B":"錯。你們的 organization 無法改變他在其他 organization 的狀態；每個 organization 各自管理自己的使用者。","C":"對。Remove user 只把他移出你們的 organization；官方寫明不會把他從其他 organization 移除，也不會永久刪除他的 Atlassian account。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/remove-or-suspend-a-user/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.3.3-e24","sec":"520.3.3","dom":"520.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Mia has Jira access through the jira-users-acme default group and through the engineering group. An org admin opens Mia's profile and selects Remove access for Jira. What is the result?","zh":"Mia 透過 jira-users-acme（default group）與 engineering 兩個 group 取得 Jira。Org admin 在她的個人頁對 Jira 選 Remove access，結果是？","zo":["Mia 被移出所有給 Jira 的 group，失去 Jira 存取","Mia 只被移出 jira-users-acme，仍透過 engineering 保有 Jira","要先移除 engineering 的 Jira 角色，否則動作會失敗"],"fig":"","opts":["Mia is removed from all groups that give access to Jira, so she loses Jira access","Mia is removed only from jira-users-acme and keeps Jira through engineering","The action fails until the engineering group's Jira role is removed"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。使用者頁 Apps 分頁的 Remove access 會把他從所有給該 app 的 group 移除，所以一次就能完整收回 Jira 存取；他仍留在 organization。","B":"錯。只把人移出 default group 才會有「還靠其他 group 保有存取」的情況；Remove access 的設計就是一次處理所有相關 group。","C":"錯。不需要先改 engineering group 的設定；Remove access 是從使用者這一端把他移出，而不是改 group 的角色。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/remove-product-access-for-users/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.3.3-e25","sec":"520.3.3","dom":"520.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. An admin tries to remove Raj's Jira access but can't complete the action. What must the admin do first?","zh":"請看圖。Admin 想收回 Raj 的 Jira 存取卻無法完成。Admin 必須先做什麼？","zo":["把 Raj 移出 jira-users-acme default group","移除 Raj 的 org admin 角色","暫停 Raj 的存取"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 258\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Raj Patel\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"256.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 H106 V257.25 H10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 -10,-10 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><line x1=\"106\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"106\" y2=\"258\" class=\"gl\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Atlassian Administration → Directory → Users</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Raj Patel</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Roles</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"95\" width=\"136.39999999999998\" height=\"20\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx rose\"/><text x=\"186.2\" y=\"109\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:11.5px\">Organization admin</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"140\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Apps</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"151\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"170\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"162\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Jira (acme)</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"162\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">User</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"177\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-teal\"/><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"196\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"196\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"188\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Confluence (acme)</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"188\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">User</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"217\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s tf-rose\" style=\"font-weight:700\">Remove access is unavailable for this</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"233\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s tf-rose\" style=\"font-weight:700\">user</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Overview</text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"65\" width=\"94\" height=\"22\" rx=\"6\" class=\"sf-brand\"/><text x=\"14\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Directory</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Apps</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Security</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"158\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Billing</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"256.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["Remove Raj from the jira-users-acme default group","Remove Raj's organization admin role","Suspend Raj's access"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。手動把他移出 default group 繞不過這個限制；問題出在 org admin 角色，不在 group。","B":"對。官方寫明使用者是 org admin 時，要先移除他的 org admin 角色，才能收回他的 app 存取。圖中 Raj 是 Organization admin。","C":"錯。Suspend 會暫停他對整個 organization 的存取，不是收回單一 app 的前置步驟，而且也不會拿掉他的 org admin 角色。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/remove-product-access-for-users/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.3.3-e26","sec":"520.3.3","dom":"520.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An organization uses centralized user management. A site admin wants to use Log in as user to check what a new hire can see in Confluence. What happens?","zh":"某 organization 使用 centralized user management。一位 site admin 想用 Log in as user 看新人在 Confluence 看得到什麼，結果如何？","zo":["可以，只要新人不是 org admin","可以，但只限他管的 site 上的使用者","不行；這個介面下只有 org admin 能以其他使用者身分登入"],"fig":"","opts":["The site admin can, as long as the new hire isn't an organization admin","The site admin can, but only for users on the site they administer","The site admin can't; only organization admins can log in as another user in this experience"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。「不能登入成同級或更高的人」是 original 介面下對 site admin 的限制；centralized 的 site admin 根本沒有這個功能。","B":"錯。依 site 限制範圍是 original 介面的做法；centralized 的 site admin 不管使用者，也不能代登。","C":"對。Centralized 介面下 Log in as user 只有 org admin 能用，site admin 的這個選項會被鎖住。Original 介面才允許 site admin 使用。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/log-in-as-another-user/","https://support.atlassian.com/atlassian-cloud/kb/site-administrator-role-in-the-centralized-user-management-and-original-user-management-experiences/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.3.3-e27","sec":"520.3.3","dom":"520.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An org admin invited Noah yesterday and wants to use Log in as user to verify his Jira permissions, but the option isn't available. Noah hasn't signed in yet. What is the reason?","zh":"Org admin 昨天邀請了 Noah，想用 Log in as user 確認他的 Jira 權限，但選項無法使用。Noah 還沒登入過，原因是？","zo":["不能登入成還沒用過 organization 內任何 app 的使用者","Log in as user 需要 Atlassian Guard","Noah 的帳號不是 managed account"],"fig":"","opts":["You can't log in as a user who hasn't accessed an app in the organization yet","Log in as user requires an Atlassian Guard subscription","Noah's account isn't a managed account"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方列出的限制之一：不能登入成還沒用過你們 organization 任何 app 的使用者。等 Noah 第一次登入後才能使用。","B":"錯。Log in as user 是所有方案都有的功能，不需要 Atlassian Guard。","C":"錯。Log in as user 不限於 managed account；限制對象是 org admin、還沒用過 app 的人、自己的帳號與 portal-only customer。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/log-in-as-another-user/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.3.3-e28","sec":"520.3.3","dom":"520.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A security team suspects that a managed account's password was exposed. The org admin selects Reset password for that account. What happens?","zh":"資安團隊懷疑某個 managed account 的密碼外洩。Org admin 對這個帳號選 Reset password，會發生什麼？","zo":["使用者收到重設連結，但現有工作階段維持登入","10 分鐘內被登出，下次登入必須換密碼","帳號被暫停，直到使用者設定新密碼"],"fig":"","opts":["The user receives a reset link, but existing sessions stay active","The user is logged out within 10 minutes and must change the password at the next login","The account is suspended until the user sets a new password"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。重設密碼會讓他被登出，不會保留現有工作階段；這正是在帳號外洩時使用它的原因。","B":"對。重設 managed account 的密碼後，系統會在 10 分鐘內把他登出，下次登入時要求換密碼；官方建議先通知使用者存檔。這個功能只對 managed account。","C":"錯。重設密碼不會改變使用者在 organization 的狀態；暫停存取是另一個動作（Suspend access）。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/make-changes-to-a-managed-user-account/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.3.3-e29","sec":"520.3.3","dom":"520.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Acme has verified acme.com. Jane's account has not been claimed. Jane is leaving the project. Which action can Acme take for Jane?","zh":"請看圖。Acme 已驗證 acme.com，但 Jane 的帳號沒有被 claim。Jane 要離開專案，Acme 可以對她做什麼？","zo":["停用她的 Atlassian account","刪除帳號前先把她的 email 改成佔位地址","暫停或移除她在 Acme organization 的存取"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 191\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Users\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"189.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 H106 V190.25 H10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 -10,-10 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><line x1=\"106\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"106\" y2=\"191\" class=\"gl\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Atlassian Administration → Directory → Users</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Users</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Directory</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"100\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-green\"/><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">liam@acme.com</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Managed</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"126\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"145\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">jane@acme.com</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">External</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s tf-violet\" style=\"font-weight:700\">Verified domain: acme.com</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Overview</text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"65\" width=\"94\" height=\"22\" rx=\"6\" class=\"sf-brand\"/><text x=\"14\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Directory</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Apps</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Security</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"158\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Billing</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"189.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["Deactivate her Atlassian account","Update her email address to a placeholder before deleting the account","Suspend or remove her access to Acme's organization"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Deactivate 只能用在 organization 擁有的 managed account；網域驗證了但沒 claim 的帳號仍是 external user。","B":"錯。修改 email、刪除帳號都屬於 managed account 的操作；Acme 不擁有 Jane 的帳號，兩件事都做不到。","C":"對。Jane 的帳號沒被 claim，對 Acme 來說是 external user：可以邀請、暫停或移除她在 Acme 的存取，但不能改她的帳號資料或刪除、停用帳號。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/what-are-managed-accounts/","https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/deactivate-a-managed-account/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.3.3-e30","sec":"520.3.3","dom":"520.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Kim is the user access admin for Jira only. Omar has access to both Jira and Confluence. Kim tries to remove Omar from the organization. What happens?","zh":"Kim 只是 Jira 的 user access admin。Omar 同時有 Jira 與 Confluence。Kim 嘗試把 Omar 移出 organization，結果？","zo":["Kim 不能移除，因為 Omar 有她不管的 app","Kim 可以，因為 user access admin 能移除任何有 Jira 的人","Kim 可以，但 Omar 的 Confluence 存取會保留"],"fig":"","opts":["Kim can't remove Omar, because he has access to an app she doesn't administer","Kim can remove Omar, because user access admins can remove any user who has Jira access","Kim can remove Omar, but only his Confluence access is preserved"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。User access admin 只能 remove 或 suspend「沒有 app 存取、或只有他所管 app 存取」的使用者。Omar 還有 Confluence，所以要由 org admin 處理。","B":"錯。只要使用者還有其他 app，user access admin 就不能把他移出 organization；這是為了避免影響他不管的 app。","C":"錯。Remove user 是把人整個移出 organization，不存在「移除但保留某個 app」的結果；而且 Kim 也沒有權限做這個動作。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/remove-or-suspend-a-user/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.3.3-e31","sec":"520.3.3","dom":"520.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An organization still uses the original user management experience. Which admins can give a user access to an app on a site?","zh":"某 organization 仍使用 original user management。哪些 admin 可以給使用者某個站台上的 app 存取？","zo":["只有 org admin","Org admin 與該站台的 site admin","Org admin 與 user access admin"],"fig":"","opts":["Only organization admins","Organization admins and site admins of that site","Organization admins and user access admins"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。「只有 org admin」不符合 original 介面的文件；original 的 site admin 可以在自己的 site 給使用者 app 角色、管理使用者。","B":"對。Original 介面下，Give app access 頁列出的角色是 org admin 與 site admin；site admin 可以在自己的 site 指派角色、管理使用者。","C":"錯。User access admin 是 centralized 介面的角色，original 介面的文件不列這個角色。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/give-users-access-to-products/","https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/how-does-product-access-work/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.3.4-e32","sec":"520.3.4","dom":"520.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An org admin grants a user the User role for Confluence from the user's profile. Which group is the user added to?","zh":"Org admin 在使用者個人頁給他 Confluence 的 User 角色。這位使用者會被加進哪個 group？","zo":["org-admins，因為是 org admin 做的變更","Confluence User 角色的 default group，例如 confluence-users-{site}","所有有 Confluence 角色的 group"],"fig":"","opts":["The org-admins group, because an org admin made the change","The default group for the Confluence User role, such as confluence-users-{site}","Every group that has a Confluence role"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。org-admins 給的是 org admin 角色，與誰操作無關；而且它不能當任何角色的 default group。","B":"對。給使用者 app 角色時，系統會把他放進該角色的 default group；例如站台 vitafleet 的 Confluence User 角色預設是 confluence-users-vitafleet。","C":"錯。只放進該角色的 default group，不會加入所有有 Confluence 角色的 group；其他 group 要另外手動加入。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/give-users-access-to-products/","https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/default-groups-and-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.3.4-e33","sec":"520.3.4","dom":"520.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An admin wants confluence-users-acme to stop being a default group so that no group is the default for the Confluence User role. What happens?","zh":"Admin 想讓 confluence-users-acme 不再是 default group，讓 Confluence User 角色沒有任何 default group。結果？","zo":["可以，之後的新 Confluence 使用者不會被加進任何 group","可以，但現有成員全部失去 Confluence","不允許；每個 app 角色至少要有一個 default group"],"fig":"","opts":["It works, and new Confluence users are no longer added to any group","It works, but every current member loses Confluence access","It isn't allowed; every app role must have at least one default group"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。不允許一個角色沒有 default group，因為系統給使用者存取時必須把他放進某個 default group。","B":"錯。拿掉 default 標籤本身不會影響成員與存取；何況這個操作在沒有替代 default 時根本做不了。","C":"對。可以更換某角色的 default group，但每個角色至少要有一個；要拿掉現有的 default，得先把另一個 group 設成這個角色的 default。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/default-groups-and-permissions/","https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/remove-product-access-for-users/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.3.4-e34","sec":"520.3.4","dom":"520.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"To simplify administration, an admin tries to make the org-admins group the default group for the Jira User role. What happens?","zh":"為了方便管理，admin 想把 org-admins group 設成 Jira User 角色的 default group。結果？","zo":["不允許，給 org admin 角色的 group 不能當任何角色的 default","可以，之後每個新 Jira 使用者也會成為 org admin","只有 org-admins 成員少於 10 人時才可以"],"fig":"","opts":["It isn't allowed, because the group that grants the organization admin role can't be a default group for any role","It works, and every new Jira user also becomes an organization admin","It works only if the org-admins group has fewer than 10 members"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。給 org admin 角色的 group 不能當任何角色的 default group，避免有人被給一般角色時意外變成 org admin。","B":"錯。正因為會發生這種權限暴增，Atlassian 從設計上禁止這麼做，而不是允許後再警告。","C":"錯。這條規則沒有人數條件；10 人是 Free 方案的使用者上限，與 default group 規則無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/default-groups-and-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.3.4-e35","sec":"520.3.4","dom":"520.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. The admin wants lab-team to also become the default group for the Confluence App admin role. What is the result?","zh":"請看圖。Admin 想讓 lab-team 也成為 Confluence App admin 角色的 default group，結果？","zo":["lab-team 要先拿掉 User 角色，才能給 App admin","lab-team 同時只能當一個角色的 default group","lab-team 會同時成為兩個角色的 default group"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 232\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Confluence (acme)\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"230.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 H106 V231.25 H10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 -10,-10 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><line x1=\"106\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"106\" y2=\"232\" class=\"gl\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Atlassian Administration → Apps → Atlassian apps</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Confluence (acme)</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">User 角色（✓＝default）</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"100\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-teal\"/><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">lab-team</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">✓</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"140\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">App admin 角色</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"151\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-violet\"/><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"170\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"162\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">confluence-admins-acme</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"162\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">✓</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"191\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s tf-violet\" style=\"font-weight:700\">lab-team ••• → Update default group</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"207\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s tf-violet\" style=\"font-weight:700\">setting</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Overview</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Directory</text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"91\" width=\"94\" height=\"22\" rx=\"6\" class=\"sf-brand\"/><text x=\"14\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Apps</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Security</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"158\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Billing</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"230.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["lab-team must first be removed from the User role before it can grant App admin","lab-team can be the default group for only one role at a time","lab-team becomes the default group for both roles"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。一個 group 可以同時給多個角色，不必先移除 User 角色；受限制的是「default」的標記，不是角色本身。","B":"對。一個 group 可以給同一個 app 的多個角色，但同時只能當其中一個角色的 default group。lab-team 已是 User 的 default，要改當 App admin 的 default 就得換掉。","C":"錯。官方規則是一個 group 一次只能當一個角色的 default，所以不會同時是兩個角色的 default。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/default-groups-and-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.3.4-e36","sec":"520.3.4","dom":"520.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An organization syncs groups from Okta with SCIM. The admin wants new users who are invited manually to land in an Okta-synced group by default. What should the admin know?","zh":"某 organization 用 SCIM 從 Okta 同步 group。Admin 想讓手動邀請的新使用者預設進到某個 Okta 同步的 group，admin 應該知道什麼？","zo":["任何 group 只要有 Jira 角色都能當 default","同步的 group 第一次同步後就自動成為 default","SCIM 同步的 group 唯讀、不能當 default，要改用內部管理的 group"],"fig":"","opts":["Any group can be a default group once it has a Jira role","Synced groups become default groups automatically after the first sync","SCIM-synced groups are read-only and can't be default groups; use an internally managed group as the default"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。不是所有 group 都能當 default：SCIM 同步的 group 與給 org admin 角色的 group 都不行。","B":"錯。同步不會自動改 default group 設定；而且從 IdP 佈建的使用者也不會自動放進 default group。","C":"對。從外部 IdP（例如 Okta）用 SCIM 同步的 group 是唯讀的，不能設成 default group；官方建議建一個內部管理的 group 當 default，同步 group 用來給權限。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/default-groups-and-permissions/","https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/troubleshoot-issues-related-to-managing-groups/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.3.4-e37","sec":"520.3.4","dom":"520.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Kim is the user access admin for Jira in a centralized organization. She needs a new group to be the default group for the Jira User role. What should she do?","zh":"Kim 是 centralized organization 的 Jira user access admin。她需要讓一個新 group 成為 Jira User 角色的 default group，該怎麼做？","zo":["請 org admin 處理，因為只有 org admin 能設定 default group","自己建 group 並設為 default，因為它只給 Jira","請 Jira app admin 在 Jira 設定裡設定"],"fig":"","opts":["Ask an organization admin, because only org admins can configure default groups","Create the group and mark it as default herself, since it only grants Jira","Ask a Jira app admin to set the default group in Jira settings"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。只有 org admin 能設定 default group，user access admin 不能把 group 設成 default 或拿掉 default 狀態，所以要請 org admin 代為處理。","B":"錯。Kim 可以建立只給 Jira 的 group 並管理成員，但「設定 default group」不在 user access admin 的權限內。","C":"錯。Default group 是在 Atlassian Administration 設定，不在 Jira 的設定頁；app admin 也進不了 Atlassian Administration。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/troubleshoot-issues-related-to-managing-groups/","https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/what-are-the-different-types-of-admin-roles/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.3.4-e38","sec":"520.3.4","dom":"520.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An admin switches the default group for the Confluence User role to a new group and then sets the old group's default setting to None. What happens to the members of the old group?","zh":"Admin 把 Confluence User 角色的 default group 換成新的 group，再把舊 group 的 default 設定改為 None。舊 group 的成員會怎樣？","zo":["自動被移到新的 default group","不變，仍保有 group 成員資格與 Confluence 存取","失去 Confluence，直到被加進新的 default group"],"fig":"","opts":["They're moved into the new default group automatically","Nothing; they keep their group membership and Confluence access","They lose Confluence access until they're added to the new default group"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。更換 default group 不會搬移任何現有成員；新 default 只影響之後被給存取的人。","B":"對。官方寫明把舊 group 的 default 設定改為 None 不影響 group 的成員與存取。改變的只是「之後新給存取的人會被放進哪個 group」。","C":"錯。舊 group 仍然有 Confluence 的 User 角色，成員的存取不受影響；要讓他們失去存取，得從 group 移除這個角色。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/default-groups-and-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.3.4-e39","sec":"520.3.4","dom":"520.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An admin renames the group 'support-l2' to 'support-tier2' in Atlassian Administration. A Jira automation rule refers to the old group name. What is the impact?","zh":"Admin 在 Atlassian Administration 把 group「support-l2」改名為「support-tier2」。有一條 Jira automation rule 用到舊名稱，影響是？","zo":["Jira 會自動把 rule 改成新名稱","沒有影響，因為 automation 用 group ID 而不是名稱","該 automation rule 會停止運作，直到更新"],"fig":"","opts":["Jira updates the rule to the new name automatically","Nothing, because automation rules use group IDs, not names","The automation rule stops working until it's updated"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。官方明確警告 rule 會停止運作，表示不會自動跟著改名；改名後要手動更新 rule。","B":"錯。若 rule 只用 ID 就不會受影響，但官方文件寫的是會停止運作，所以不能這樣假設。","C":"對。官方提醒：改了 Jira automation 用到的 group 名稱，這個 rule 會停止運作。改名是 beta 功能，被某些 Jira 管理設定使用時甚至改不了。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/edit-a-group/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.3.4-e40","sec":"520.3.4","dom":"520.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"On an older site in the centralized user management experience, an admin adds a user to the site-admins group. What does the user become?","zh":"在 centralized user management 的舊站台，admin 把一位使用者加進 site-admins group。他會變成什麼？","zo":["Org admin，因為這個 group 連到 org admin 角色","只有該站台的 site admin","該站台的 Jira app admin"],"fig":"","opts":["An organization admin, because this group is associated with the org admin role","A site admin for that site only","A Jira app admin for that site"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。Centralized 介面下，舊站的 site-admins group 其實連到 org admin 角色（新站叫 org-admins）；centralized 的 site admin 角色不連任何 group，不能用 group 指派。","B":"錯。名稱容易誤導，但 centralized 的 site admin 角色只能從使用者頁的 Assign site admin role 指派，不連到任何 group。","C":"錯。Jira 的 app admin 由 jira-admins-{site} 這類 group 給予，不是 site-admins。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/atlassian-cloud/kb/site-administrator-role-in-the-centralized-user-management-and-original-user-management-experiences/","https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/default-groups-and-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.3.4-e41","sec":"520.3.4","dom":"520.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. A Confluence admin wants to give only Carlos, a contractor, the Create space global permission. What should happen?","zh":"請看圖。Confluence admin 想只讓承包商 Carlos 有 Create space 全域權限，應該怎麼做？","zo":["讓 Carlos 成為 Confluence space admin，就包含 Create space","把 Carlos 加進某個 group，再把 Create space 給那個 group","在這一頁把 Carlos 以個人身分加入"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 191\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Global permissions\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"189.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Confluence → Settings → Security → Permissions</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Global permissions</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Create space</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"100\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">confluence-users-acme</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">✓</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"126\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-gray\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"145\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">contractors</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">—</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s tf-violet\" style=\"font-weight:700\">Global permissions can only be assigned to groups</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"189.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["Make Carlos a Confluence space admin, which includes Create space","Add Carlos to a group and grant Create space to that group","Add Carlos as an individual user on this page"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Space admin 是單一 space 內的權限；建立新 space 屬於 global permission 的 Create space，兩者是不同層級。","B":"對。Confluence 的 global permissions 只能給 group，不能給個人。要給單一使用者，就讓他成為某個 group 的成員（可以新建一個），再把權限給那個 group。","C":"錯。圖中與官方文件都寫明 global permissions 只能指派給 group；這一頁沒有加入個別使用者的選項。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/confluence-cloud/docs/manage-global-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.3.5-e42","sec":"520.3.5","dom":"520.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An admin deletes the group 'qa-contractors', which was used in a Jira permission scheme. What happens to the group's members?","zh":"Admin 刪除了 Jira permission scheme 用到的 group「qa-contractors」。這個 group 的成員會怎樣？","zo":["保留所有權限，因為 Jira 會把權限複製給每個人","仍在 organization，但失去只靠這個 group 取得的存取與權限","隨著 group 一起被移出 organization"],"fig":"","opts":["They keep every permission because Jira copies them to each user","They stay in the organization, but lose any access or permissions they had only through that group","They're removed from the organization along with the group"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Jira 的權限是給 group 的，不會在刪除前複製到個人；group 消失後，靠它取得的權限也跟著失去。","B":"對。刪除 group 不會把使用者移出 organization；但透過這個 group 拿到的 app 角色與 app 內權限，對原成員不再有效（還在其他 group 拿到的不受影響）。","C":"錯。官方寫明刪 group 不會移除使用者；要讓人離開 organization 是 remove user 這個動作。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/delete-a-group/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.3.5-e43","sec":"520.3.5","dom":"520.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Before deleting a group that's no longer needed, what does Atlassian recommend if the group is still used in app permissions?","zh":"要刪除一個不再需要、但仍被 app 權限使用的 group 前，Atlassian 建議怎麼做？","zo":["直接刪除，權限會自動清除","改名就好，因為刪掉的 group 不能再建","先移除這個 group 的權限，避免日後建立同名 group 時自動套回"],"fig":"","opts":["Delete the group immediately; permissions are cleaned up automatically","Rename the group instead, because deleted groups can't be recreated","Remove the group's permissions first, so they aren't assigned again automatically if a group with the same name is created later"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。正因為權限不會被自動清掉，官方才特別提醒先移除；同名 group 重建時權限會回來。","B":"錯。刪除後可以再建立同名 group，這正是風險所在；改名也受限制（例如被 Jira 設定使用時不能改）。","C":"對。官方建議：若成員不再需要這些權限，先移除這個 group 的所有權限再刪。否則日後有人建立同名 group，權限會自動套回。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/delete-a-group/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.3.5-e44","sec":"520.3.5","dom":"520.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"The 'marketing' group has a Jira role. Ana is in 'marketing' and also in the jira-users-acme default group. An admin removes Jira from the 'marketing' group. What happens to Ana?","zh":"「marketing」group 有 Jira 角色。Ana 在 marketing，也在 jira-users-acme default group。Admin 把 Jira 從 marketing 移除，Ana 會怎樣？","zo":["透過 jira-users-acme 保有 Jira","立刻失去 Jira","被移出兩個 group"],"fig":"","opts":["She keeps Jira access through jira-users-acme","She loses Jira access immediately","She's removed from both groups"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。從 group 移除 app 後，成員若還在其他給同一個 app 的 group，存取不受影響。Ana 仍透過 jira-users-acme 保有 Jira。","B":"錯。只有「只靠 marketing 拿到 Jira」的人才會失去存取；Ana 還有另一個來源。","C":"錯。從 group 移除 app 角色不會改變任何人的 group 成員資格；Ana 仍在兩個 group 裡。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/remove-product-access-for-users/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.3.5-e45","sec":"520.3.5","dom":"520.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. An admin tries to rename the 'Developers' group and gets this error. What should the admin do?","zh":"請看圖。Admin 想改「Developers」group 的名稱，出現這個錯誤。Admin 應該怎麼做？","zo":["請 Atlassian Support 強制改名","找出引用這個 group 的 Jira filter，修改或刪除後再改名","刪除 group，再用新名稱建一個"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 197\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Developers\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"195.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 H106 V196.25 H10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 -10,-10 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><line x1=\"106\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"106\" y2=\"197\" class=\"gl\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Atlassian Administration → Directory → Groups</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Developers</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s tf-rose\" style=\"font-weight:700\">We&#x27;re unable to edit the group name</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"105\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s tf-rose\" style=\"font-weight:700\">Developers, as it is used in Jira</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"121\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s tf-rose\" style=\"font-weight:700\">administration settings.</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"145\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Remove the group from:</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"156\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"175\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"175\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"167\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">acme.atlassian.net</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"167\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">JQL Filters - Result</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Overview</text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"65\" width=\"94\" height=\"22\" rx=\"6\" class=\"sf-brand\"/><text x=\"14\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Directory</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Apps</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Security</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"158\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Billing</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"195.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["Ask Atlassian Support to force the rename","Find the saved Jira filters that reference the group, change or delete them, then rename the group","Delete the group and create a new group with the new name"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。這是預期的保護機制，處理方式是先移除引用；官方 KB 提供的解法是找出並調整 filter。","B":"對。Jira Cloud 在 group 被 filter、權限或其他設定使用時會擋下改名；錯誤訊息會列出是哪一類設定。先改掉或刪掉引用它的 filter，改名後再把 filter 改回新名稱。","C":"錯。刪掉再建會讓透過這個 group 的權限與 filter 參照一起失效，影響比改名大得多，不是合適的做法。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/unable-to-edit-group-name-error-in-jira-cloud/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.3.5-e46","sec":"520.3.5","dom":"520.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Jira admin wants to be alerted when users are deactivated so their work items can be reassigned. Which approach matches Atlassian's guidance?","zh":"Jira admin 想在使用者被停用（deactivate）時收到提醒，以便重新指派他們的 work item。哪個做法符合 Atlassian 的建議？","zo":["用 Jira automation 的「User deactivated」觸發器","請 org admin 在 Jira 設定中開啟停用通知","用排程 automation rule 找出 assignee in inactiveUsers() 的 work item 並發出提醒"],"fig":"","opts":["Use the 'User deactivated' trigger in Jira automation","Ask the org admin to enable deactivation notifications in Jira settings","Use a scheduled automation rule that looks up work items with assignee in inactiveUsers() and sends an alert"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Jira automation 只能由 work item 或 Jira 內的事件觸發；deactivation 發生在 Atlassian Administration，所以沒有這種觸發器可直接用。","B":"錯。Jira 設定裡沒有這種通知開關；deactivate 時 Atlassian 會寄信給使用者本人，但不會替你找出要重新指派的 work item。","C":"對。使用者被 deactivate 是 user management 的事件，不是 Jira 的事件；官方 KB 的做法是排程 rule，用 JQL inactiveUsers() 找出受影響的 work item 再寄信或發 Slack。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/email-or-slack-a-list-of-work-items-assigned-to-deactivated-users-in-jira/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":1},{"id":"520.3.5-e47","sec":"520.3.5","dom":"520.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An org admin deletes a managed account. What will other users see on Confluence pages and Jira work items that the person created after the deletion completes?","zh":"Org admin 刪除了一個 managed account。刪除完成後，其他人在他建立的 Confluence 頁面與 Jira work item 上會看到什麼？","zo":["內容保留，作者顯示為 Former user","頁面與 work item 隨帳號一起被刪除","內容被改到執行刪除的 org admin 名下"],"fig":"","opts":["The content remains, and the author appears as Former user","The pages and work items are deleted with the account","The content is reassigned to the org admin who deleted the account"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。刪除 managed account 會刪個人資料，但不刪他在 app 裡建立的 page、work item、comment。14 天寬限期結束後，名稱會被替換成 Former user。","B":"錯。官方列出「不會刪除的資料」就包括使用者建立的內容；刪的是姓名、email 等個人資料。","C":"錯。Atlassian 不會自動把內容改到執行刪除的 admin 名下；內容保留，作者顯示為 Former user。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/delete-a-managed-account/","https://support.atlassian.com/atlassian-account/docs/delete-your-atlassian-account/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.3.5-e48","sec":"520.3.5","dom":"520.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Confluence admin needs to stop one user from using Confluence without removing any groups from Confluence. What should be done?","zh":"Confluence admin 要讓某一位使用者不能使用 Confluence，但不想從 Confluence 移除任何 group。應該怎麼做？","zo":["對這位使用者關閉 Personal space 全域權限","把這位使用者移出所有有 Confluence 存取的 group","在每個 space 拿掉他的 View 權限"],"fig":"","opts":["Turn off the Personal space global permission for the user","Remove the user from every group that has Confluence access","Remove the user's View permission in each space"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Global permissions 只能給 group，不能針對個人關閉；Personal space 也只影響是否自動建立個人空間。","B":"對。Confluence 的 licensed users 都是透過 group 取得存取；不移除任何 group 時，要把這位使用者移出所有有 Confluence 存取的 group。","C":"錯。逐個 space 拿掉 View 權限只是在 app 內限制看不到內容，他仍是 Confluence 使用者、仍計費，也不是「停用 Confluence」。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/confluence-cloud/docs/manage-global-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.3.5-e49","sec":"520.3.5","dom":"520.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"The only space admin of a Confluence space left the company and was removed. No one can now change that space's permissions. How can this be fixed?","zh":"某 Confluence space 唯一的 space admin 離職且已被移除，現在沒人能改這個 space 的權限。怎麼解決？","zo":["Org admin 還原被移除的使用者，否則無法找回權限","刪除 space 再用新權限重建","Confluence admin 用 Recover Permissions 成為 space admin，再指派新的 admin"],"fig":"","opts":["An org admin restores the removed user, because space permissions can't be recovered otherwise","Delete the space and recreate it with new permissions","A Confluence admin uses Recover Permissions to become a space admin and assign a new one"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。不需要找回離職者；被 remove 的人要重新邀請並重設角色，而且官方已提供 Recover Permissions 解決這種情況。","B":"錯。刪除 space 會連內容一起進垃圾桶，代價過大；Recover Permissions 才是官方的做法。","C":"對。Confluence admin 與 site admin 隨時能取得 space 權限的控制：在 Space management 找到該 space 選 Recover Permissions，暫時成為 space admin 再指派新 admin，這會記錄在 audit log。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/confluence-cloud/docs/manage-global-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.3.5-e50","sec":"520.3.5","dom":"520.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Kim, the user access admin for Jira, must remove Jira access from Ravi. Ravi is in the okta-engineering group, which is synced from Okta and grants Jira. What is the correct path?","zh":"請看圖。Jira user access admin Kim 必須收回 Ravi 的 Jira。Ravi 在從 Okta 同步、給 Jira 的 okta-engineering group 裡。正確的做法是？","zo":["由 org admin 在 IdP 把 Ravi 移出 okta-engineering","Kim 在 Atlassian Administration 把 Ravi 移出 okta-engineering","Kim 刪除 okta-engineering group"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 218\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Ravi\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"216.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 H106 V217.25 H10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 -10,-10 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><line x1=\"106\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"106\" y2=\"218\" class=\"gl\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Atlassian Administration → Directory → Users</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Ravi</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Groups</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"100\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">jira-users-acme</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Default</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"126\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-violet\"/><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"145\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">okta-engineering</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Synced (SCIM)</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Apps</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"177\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"196\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"196\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"188\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Jira (acme)</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"188\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">User</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Overview</text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"65\" width=\"94\" height=\"22\" rx=\"6\" class=\"sf-brand\"/><text x=\"14\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Directory</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Apps</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Security</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"158\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Billing</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"216.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["An org admin removes Ravi from okta-engineering in the identity provider","Kim removes Ravi from okta-engineering in Atlassian Administration","Kim deletes the okta-engineering group"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。SCIM 同步的 group 是唯讀的，不能在 Atlassian Administration 把人移出；要由 org admin 在 IdP 把他移出該 group，Kim 之後才能處理 default group 的部分。","B":"錯。圖中 group 標示為 synced；SCIM group 在 Atlassian Administration 是唯讀的，無法直接移除成員。","C":"錯。刪除同步 group 一樣受唯讀限制，而且會影響群組裡所有人的存取，遠超過「只收回 Ravi」的需求。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/troubleshoot-issues-related-to-managing-groups/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.3.5-e51","sec":"520.3.5","dom":"520.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Two organizations that both use centralized user management are consolidated. Each has a group named 'engineering'. What happens to the group from the source organization?","zh":"兩個都使用 centralized user management 的 organization 進行合併，雙方都有名為「engineering」的 group。來源 organization 的那個會怎樣？","zo":["來源 group 被刪除，成員失去 app 存取","在來源端改名為 {groupName}-{SourceOrgName}","兩個 group 合併成一個，包含所有成員"],"fig":"","opts":["The source group is deleted and its members lose app access","It's renamed in the source using the format {groupName}-{SourceOrgName}","The two groups are merged into one group with all members"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Consolidation 是把來源的 site、app、使用者搬到目的地，同名 group 會改名保留，不會被刪除。","B":"對。官方 consolidation 指南寫明：兩邊同名的 group，來源 organization 的會被改名成 {groupName}-{SourceOrgName}，避免衝突與權限混在一起。","C":"錯。直接合併同名 group 會把兩邊成員的權限混在一起，造成權限擴大；所以採改名而不是合併。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/atlassian-cloud/kb/atlassian-organization-consolidation-guide/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.4.1-e01","sec":"520.4.1","dom":"520.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. The admin takes no action on old-acme.com for the next 14 days. What happens?","zh":"請看圖。接下來 14 天 admin 都沒有處理 old-acme.com。會發生什麼？","zo":["網域變成 Unverified，該網域的 managed account 變成 unclaimed","該網域的 managed account 被停用，不再計費","Atlassian 自動改用另一種方法重新驗證網域"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 167\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Domains\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"165.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Atlassian Administration → Directory → Domains</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Domains</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Domains</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"100\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-green\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">acme.com</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Verified</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"126\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"145\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">old-acme.com</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Verified (expires soon)</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"165.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["The domain becomes Unverified and its managed accounts become unclaimed","The managed accounts on the domain are deactivated and no longer billed","Atlassian re-verifies the domain automatically using a different method"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。Verified (expires soon) 代表所有驗證方法都缺 token；14 天內沒有補上，網域會變成 Unverified，這個網域的 managed account 也會變成 unclaimed。","B":"錯。Deactivate 是 admin 對 managed account 做的動作，會讓帳號無法登入並停止計費；網域失去驗證只會讓帳號變成 unclaimed，不會停用帳號。","C":"錯。Atlassian 只會定期檢查你提供的 HTML 檔或 TXT record，不會自己換方法替你驗證；要避免這種情況，應事先用第二種方法驗證。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/verify-a-domain-to-manage-accounts/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.4.1-e02","sec":"520.4.1","dom":"520.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Acme verified acme.com and chose to claim only the accounts listed in a CSV file. Jane signed up with jane@acme.com but wasn't in the file. How is Jane's account treated?","zh":"Acme 驗證了 acme.com，並選擇只 claim CSV 檔裡列出的帳號。Jane 用 jane@acme.com 註冊，但不在檔案裡。Jane 的帳號會被如何看待？","zo":["在 admin claim 之前是 suspended 帳號","視為 organization 的 external user","視為 managed account，因為網域已驗證"],"fig":"","opts":["As a suspended account until an admin claims it","As an external user of the organization","As a managed account, because the domain is verified"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Suspend 是 admin 暫停某人存取的動作，不會因為帳號沒被 claim 而自動發生；沒被 claim 的帳號照樣能依 app 存取設定使用 app。","B":"對。Managed account 要同時滿足「網域已驗證」與「帳號已被 claim」。Jane 的網域雖已驗證，但帳號沒被 claim，所以仍是 external user，Acme 不能改她的資料或刪除她的帳號。","C":"錯。只驗證網域不夠。驗證網域是證明你擁有它，claim 才是把個別帳號納入管理；官方範例中 Jane 用 acme.com 但沒被 claim，所以是 external user。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/what-are-managed-accounts/","https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/verify-a-domain-to-manage-accounts/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.4.1-e03","sec":"520.4.1","dom":"520.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An org admin must prove ownership of a company domain so its accounts can be claimed. Which methods can the admin use?","zh":"Org admin 要證明擁有公司網域，才能 claim 該網域的帳號。可以用哪些方法？","zo":["回覆寄到該網域 postmaster 信箱的驗證信","新增指向 Atlassian 郵件伺服器的 MX record","透過 HTTPS 上傳驗證用的 HTML 檔，或新增 DNS TXT record"],"fig":"","opts":["Reply to a verification email sent to the domain's postmaster address","Add an MX record that points to Atlassian's mail servers","Upload a verification HTML file over HTTPS, or add a DNS TXT record"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。網域驗證不是用 email 確認的。寄驗證信是給個別 managed account 確認 email 地址用的（Resend verification email），和證明網域所有權無關。","B":"錯。MX record 決定收信伺服器，Atlassian 的網域驗證不用它；custom email 用的是 DKIM、bounce 等 CNAME 與 TXT record，也不是 MX。","C":"對。Directory → Domains 提供 HTTPS（把 atlassian-domain-verification.html 放在網站根目錄）與 DNS TXT record 兩種方法；連接 Google Workspace 或 Microsoft Entra ID 也會自動驗證網域。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/verify-a-domain-to-manage-accounts/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.4.1-e04","sec":"520.4.1","dom":"520.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An employee with a managed account is taking a six-month sabbatical. The admin wants to stop billing for the account but keep the user's roles and group memberships for their return. What should the admin do?","zh":"一位擁有 managed account 的員工要休六個月長假。Admin 想停止這個帳號的計費，但保留他的角色與 group，等他回來。Admin 應該怎麼做？","zo":["停用（deactivate）帳號，之後再重新啟用","刪除帳號，之後再取消刪除","Unclaim 帳號，之後再重新 claim"],"fig":"","opts":["Deactivate the account, then reactivate it later","Delete the account, then cancel the deletion later","Unclaim the account, then claim it again later"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。Deactivate 暫時關閉帳號、停止計費，但保留個人資料、角色與 group；隨時可以 Reactivate。官方也建議預期會回來的人用 deactivate 而不是 delete。","B":"錯。Delete 會先停用 14 天，只能在這 14 天內取消；六個月後帳號早已永久刪除，名稱變成 Former user，角色與 group 都回不來。","C":"錯。Unclaim 只是讓 organization 不再管理這個帳號，使用者的 app 存取不變，所以仍會計費；它不是暫停存取的工具。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/deactivate-a-managed-account/","https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/delete-a-managed-account/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.4.1-e05","sec":"520.4.1","dom":"520.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An organization provisions users from Okta. An admin deletes a departed employee's managed account in Atlassian Administration, but the account is recreated and the person can still log in. What did the admin miss?","zh":"某 organization 從 Okta provision 使用者。Admin 在 Atlassian Administration 刪除了一位離職員工的 managed account，但帳號又被建立回來，他仍能登入。Admin 漏了什麼？","zo":["等 14 天寬限期過了再讓使用者登入","刪除帳號前，先從 identity provider 移除這個使用者","刪除帳號前，先 unclaim 帳號"],"fig":"","opts":["Waiting for the 14-day grace period to pass before the user logs in again","Removing the user from the identity provider before deleting the account","Unclaiming the account before deleting it"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。14 天是刪除前的停用期，期間帳號本來就無法使用；帳號被重建的原因是 IdP 仍在同步這個人，與等不等 14 天無關。","B":"對。用 IdP provisioning 時，官方要求先在 IdP 移除使用者再刪帳號；否則 IdP 會再次建立 Atlassian 帳號，他也還能登入。停用帳號同樣要在 IdP 做。","C":"錯。Unclaim 會讓你失去對帳號的管理權，反而無法刪除它；deactivate 與 delete 都只能用在 managed account。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/delete-a-managed-account/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.4.1-e06","sec":"520.4.1","dom":"520.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"After verifying acme.com, the admin chooses to claim all accounts. What happens to Atlassian accounts that people create later with an @acme.com address?","zh":"驗證 acme.com 後，admin 選擇 claim 全部帳號。之後有人用 @acme.com 地址新建的 Atlassian 帳號會怎樣？","zo":["在 admin 用 CSV 上傳之前，維持 external user","要等使用者接受邀請後才會被 claim","自動被 claim，並加進 default authentication policy"],"fig":"","opts":["They stay external until the admin uploads them in a CSV file","They're claimed only after each user accepts an invitation","They're claimed automatically and added to the default authentication policy"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。上傳 CSV 是「只 claim 部分帳號」的做法，適合 IT 分散的公司；選了 claim 全部就不需要再手動上傳。","B":"錯。Claim 不需要使用者接受邀請；Atlassian 只會通知使用者他的帳號現在由 organization 管理。邀請是給 app 存取用的另一件事。","C":"對。選擇 claim 全部時，Atlassian 會 claim 所有現有帳號，也會在新帳號建立時自動 claim，並把它們加進 default authentication policy；這也是用 SAML Just-in-time 建帳號時建議的設定。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/verify-a-domain-to-manage-accounts/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.4.2-e07","sec":"520.4.2","dom":"520.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which capability requires Atlassian Guard Premium rather than Atlassian Guard Standard?","zh":"哪個功能需要 Atlassian Guard Premium，而不是 Atlassian Guard Standard？","zo":["用 SCIM 從 identity provider 做 user provisioning","Confluence 與 Jira 的敏感資料偵測","Managed account 的 SAML single sign-on"],"fig":"","opts":["User provisioning from an identity provider with SCIM","Sensitive data detection in Confluence and Jira","SAML single sign-on for managed accounts"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。用 SCIM 從 IdP 同步使用者與 group（user provisioning）屬於 Guard Standard，不需要 Premium。","B":"對。Guard 方案表把 sensitive data detection、threat detection、data classification 列為 Guard Premium。Guard Premium 是 Guard Standard 的加購，包含 Standard 的全部功能再加這些偵測與分類能力。","C":"錯。SAML single sign-on 是 Guard Standard 就有的功能，前提是網域已驗證，並在 authentication policy 裡強制 SSO。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/security-and-access-policies/docs/atlassian-guard-product-and-plan-availability/","https://support.atlassian.com/security-and-access-policies/docs/understand-atlassian-guard/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.4.2-e08","sec":"520.4.2","dom":"520.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An organization has 100 managed accounts with access to Jira Standard. Fifty of them also use Confluence Standard. How many users count toward the Atlassian Guard Standard bill?","zh":"某 organization 有 100 個 managed account 能用 Jira Standard，其中 50 人也用 Confluence Standard。Atlassian Guard Standard 帳單算幾人？","zo":["150","50","100"],"fig":"","opts":["150","50","100"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。150 是把 Jira 與 Confluence 的人數相加，等於同一個人算了兩次；Guard Standard 的計費使用者不重複計算。","B":"錯。50 只算了同時用兩個 app 的人。只用 Jira 的 50 人一樣有支援的 app 存取，也要算進去。","C":"對。Guard Standard 依 organization 計費，每個有 app 存取的 managed account 或 external user 只算一次，不論他能用幾個 app；所以是 100 人，這正是官方帳單範例。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/subscriptions-and-billing/docs/manage-your-bill-for-atlassian-access/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.4.2-e09","sec":"520.4.2","dom":"520.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. A new employee's account on the verified domain is claimed automatically. Which authentication policy will the account belong to?","zh":"請看圖。一位新員工在已驗證網域上的帳號被自動 claim。這個帳號會屬於哪個 authentication policy？","zo":["Employees，因為它是 default policy","Contractors，因為它最嚴格","都不屬於，要等 admin 把帳號加進某個 policy"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 167\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Authentication policies\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"165.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Atlassian Administration → User security</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Authentication policies</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Policies</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"100\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Employees（Default）</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">SSO enforced</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"126\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-teal\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"145\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Contractors</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">2SV mandatory</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"165.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["Employees, because it's the default policy","Contractors, because it's the most restrictive policy","None, until an admin adds the account to a policy"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。每個 organization 都有 default policy；新 provision 或被自動 claim 的 managed account 會自動加進 default policy。圖中標示 Default 的是 Employees。","B":"錯。Atlassian 不會依嚴格程度挑 policy。要讓某人屬於 Contractors，admin 要在 Members 分頁加入或用 Change member's policy 移過去。","C":"錯。新帳號不會停在「沒有 policy」的狀態；它們自動進 default policy。官方反而提醒：不想讓他們在 default policy，要手動移出。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/security-and-access-policies/docs/what-is-a-default-authentication-policy/","https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/verify-a-domain-to-manage-accounts/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.4.2-e10","sec":"520.4.2","dom":"520.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An admin has enforced SAML single sign-on in an authentication policy and now wants to require two-step verification for the same members. Where should this be configured?","zh":"Admin 已在某個 authentication policy 強制 SAML single sign-on，現在想對同一批成員要求兩步驟驗證。應該在哪裡設定？","zo":["在 Atlassian Administration 每位成員的 Security 分頁","在 identity provider","在 authentication policy 的兩步驟驗證設定"],"fig":"","opts":["On each member's Security tab in Atlassian Administration","In the identity provider","In the authentication policy's two-step verification setting"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。使用者頁的 Security 分頁可以 reset 2SV、登出裝置、撤銷 API token，但不能替個人強制 2SV；強制 2SV 是 policy 層級的設定。","B":"對。啟用 SSO 後，2SV 只能在 identity provider 設定；SAML 登入時會略過 Atlassian 的密碼政策與 2SV，所以官方建議改用 IdP 的同類功能。","C":"錯。Authentication policy 的 2SV（Mandatory／Optional）只在沒有強制 SSO 時有效；強制 SSO 後這個設定會被略過。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/security-and-access-policies/docs/authentication-policy-settings-for-your-organizations/","https://support.atlassian.com/security-and-access-policies/docs/configure-saml-single-sign-on-with-an-identity-provider/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.4.2-e11","sec":"520.4.2","dom":"520.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Contractors use personal Gmail accounts to access the company's Jira. Security wants them to confirm their identity with a code sent to their email before they can see app data. What should the admin configure?","zh":"外包人員用個人 Gmail 帳號使用公司的 Jira。資安要求他們在看到 app 資料前，先用寄到 email 的代碼確認身分。Admin 應該設定什麼？","zo":["把外包人員加進兩步驟驗證設為 Mandatory 的 authentication policy","驗證 gmail.com，並對這些帳號強制 SAML single sign-on","把 external user policy 的 authorization method 設為 One-time passcode"],"fig":"","opts":["Add the contractors to an authentication policy with two-step verification set to Mandatory","Verify gmail.com and enforce SAML single sign-on for those accounts","Set the external user policy's authorization method to One-time passcode"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Authentication policy 的成員只能是 managed account；Gmail 帳號不是你的 managed account，加不進去。","B":"錯。gmail.com 這類公用網域不能驗證，而 SAML SSO 只適用已驗證網域的帳號，所以這條路走不通。","C":"對。這些人是 external user。External user policy 的 Authorization method 可選 single sign-on、one-time passcode 或 None；選 one-time passcode 後，他們存取資料前要輸入寄到 email 的一次性密碼。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/security-and-access-policies/docs/available-external-user-security-settings/","https://support.atlassian.com/security-and-access-policies/docs/enforce-two-step-verification/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.4.2-e12","sec":"520.4.2","dom":"520.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. A developer left the project, but the API token on their managed account was used yesterday. What should the admin do on this page?","zh":"請看圖。某位開發者已離開專案，但他 managed account 的 API token 昨天還被使用。Admin 應該在這一頁做什麼？","zo":["對這把 token 選 Revoke，它會被永久刪除","在這一頁把 token 的到期日改成一天後","暫停這把 token，必要時可以還原"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 205\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"API token activity\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"203.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Atlassian Administration → Insights</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">API token activity</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Tokens</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"100\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">deploy-script（Mia Chen）</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Last used: yesterday</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"145\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">ci-bot（Ken Wu）</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Expires in 30 days</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"155\" width=\"113.5\" height=\"26\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"68.75\" y=\"172\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\">Revoke tokens</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"203.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["Select Revoke for the token, which permanently deletes it","Change the token's expiration to one day from this page","Suspend the token so it can be restored if needed"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。Insights → API token activity 集中列出 managed account 的 user API token，可以對一把或多把選 Revoke。撤銷會永久刪除 token，無法復原，使用者之後要重新建立。","B":"錯。Token 的到期天數（1～365 天）是在 authentication policy 裡設定、套用到該 policy 的成員，不是在 API token activity 頁逐把修改。","C":"錯。User API token 沒有「暫停」這個狀態；這裡只能撤銷，而撤銷是永久的。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/revoke-user-api-tokens/","https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/view-user-api-tokens/","https://support.atlassian.com/security-and-access-policies/docs/authentication-policy-settings-for-your-organizations/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.4.2-e13","sec":"520.4.2","dom":"520.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An admin discovers that employees have been signing up for their own Jira sites with their company email addresses. Which Atlassian Guard Standard capability helps the admin find these sites?","zh":"Admin 發現員工用公司 email 自己註冊了 Jira site。哪個 Atlassian Guard Standard 功能能幫 admin 找出這些 site？","zo":["IP allowlist 設定","探索 shadow IT app","Atlassian Administration 的 Apps 頁"],"fig":"","opts":["The IP allowlist settings","Discovering shadow IT apps","The Apps page in Atlassian Administration"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。IP allowlist 限制使用者從哪些 IP 存取你 organization 的 app 內容，不會告訴你員工在外面開了哪些 site。","B":"對。使用者自己註冊、自己管理的 app 稱為 shadow IT（discovered apps）。有 Guard Standard 時，managed account 註冊 Atlassian app 會通知 admin，清單在 Shadow IT apps 畫面。","C":"錯。Apps 頁只列出你 organization 底下的 app；shadow IT app 不屬於你的 organization，所以官方明說在 Apps 頁找不到它們。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/what-is-the-impact-of-shadow-it-on-my-organization/","https://support.atlassian.com/security-and-access-policies/docs/discover-products-your-users-administer/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.4.2-e14","sec":"520.4.2","dom":"520.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"After connecting Microsoft Entra ID with SCIM user provisioning, an admin tries to rename a group that was synced from the identity provider. What happens?","zh":"用 SCIM user provisioning 連接 Microsoft Entra ID 之後，admin 想把一個從 IdP 同步來的 group 改名。會發生什麼？","zo":["在 Atlassian 改名成功，並回寫到 IdP","在 Atlassian 改名成功，但下次同步時被改回去","Admin 在 Atlassian 無法編輯它；同步來的 group 是唯讀，要在 IdP 管理"],"fig":"","opts":["The rename succeeds in Atlassian and is pushed back to the identity provider","The rename succeeds in Atlassian but is reverted at the next sync","The admin can't edit it in Atlassian; synced groups are read-only and managed in the identity provider"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。同步方向是從 IdP 到 Atlassian；Atlassian 這邊不能改 synced group，也不會把變更回寫到 IdP。","B":"錯。這個選項假設 Atlassian 允許先改名、之後再被覆蓋；實際上 synced group 是唯讀，一開始就改不了。","C":"對。SCIM 推過來的 group 在 organization 目錄裡是唯讀的，只能在 IdP 修改；連上 IdP 後，使用者屬性與 group 成員也都改由 IdP 管理。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/provisioning-users/docs/understand-user-provisioning/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.4.3-e15","sec":"520.4.3","dom":"520.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An organization wants to restrict access to Jira and Confluence content to its office IP ranges. Which plan is required for these apps?","zh":"某 organization 想把 Jira 與 Confluence 內容的存取限制在辦公室 IP 範圍。這些 app 需要哪個方案？","zo":["Premium","Standard","Free，加上 Atlassian Guard Standard 訂閱"],"fig":"","opts":["Premium","Standard","Free with an Atlassian Guard Standard subscription"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。IP allowlist 對 Jira、Jira Service Management、Confluence、Compass 要 Premium 方案；Atlassian Analytics 與 Focus 則要 Enterprise。考綱也把 IP allowlisting 歸在 Premium 功能。","B":"錯。Standard 方案沒有 IP allowlist。Standard 能用 data residency，但限制來源 IP 要升級到 Premium。","C":"錯。官方的 IP allowlist 方案條件只看 app 方案，沒有列 Guard Standard；Guard 提供的是 SSO、provisioning 等身分相關功能。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/security-and-access-policies/docs/specify-ip-addresses-for-product-access/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.4.3-e16","sec":"520.4.3","dom":"520.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. A user outside the office network asks Rovo Chat to summarize a page in an allowlisted Confluence space. What is most likely to happen?","zh":"請看圖。一位在辦公室網路外的使用者請 Rovo Chat 摘要某個受 allowlist 保護的 Confluence space 裡的頁面。最可能發生什麼？","zo":["使用者在 Rovo 看到 IP allowlist 訊息，必須回辦公室連線","Rovo 仍可能回傳摘要與頁面標題，因為 allowlist 沒有選 Rovo","Rovo 自動被擋，因為 Confluence 的 allowlist 涵蓋所有 Rovo 功能"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 233\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"IP allowlist: Office\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"231.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Atlassian Administration → Device security</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">IP allowlist: Office</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Apps</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"95\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><path d=\"M15,102 l3,3 l5,-6\" class=\"ln\" style=\"stroke:var(--on-color);stroke-width:2\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\">acme（Jira）</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"116\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><path d=\"M15,123 l3,3 l5,-6\" class=\"ln\" style=\"stroke:var(--on-color);stroke-width:2\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"127\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\">acme（Confluence）</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"137\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"148\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Rovo</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"177\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">IP addresses</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"183\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"201\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t mono\" style=\"font-size:11px\">203.0.113.0/24</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"231.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["The user sees the IP allowlist message in Rovo and must reconnect from the office","Rovo can still return a summary and page titles, because Rovo isn't selected in the allowlist","Rovo is blocked automatically, because the Confluence allowlist covers all Rovo experiences"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。只有 Rovo 被選進 allowlist 時才會擋 Rovo；圖中 Rovo 沒勾，所以不會出現限制訊息。","B":"對。Jira、Confluence 的 allowlist 不會套到所有 Rovo 功能；沒在 allowlist 選 Rovo 時，Rovo 仍可能帶出受限內容的標題、預覽或摘要。官方就用這個情境當例子。","C":"錯。官方明說個別 app 的 IP allowlist 不會套用到所有 Rovo 功能；Rovo 要在 organization 層級另外選進 allowlist。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/security-and-access-policies/docs/specify-ip-addresses-for-product-access/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.4.3-e17","sec":"520.4.3","dom":"520.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An admin activates an IP allowlist that accidentally excludes their own IP address. Jira now shows an access message to everyone, including the admin. How can the admin fix this?","zh":"Admin 啟用了一個 IP allowlist，卻不小心沒把自己的 IP 放進去。現在連 admin 在內，所有人打開 Jira 都看到存取限制訊息。Admin 怎麼修正？","zo":["用 user API token 呼叫 Jira REST API 停用 allowlist","等 allowlist 24 小時後自動失效","到 admin.atlassian.com（不受 allowlist 限制）編輯 allowlist"],"fig":"","opts":["Call the Jira REST API with a user API token to disable the allowlist","Wait for the allowlist to expire automatically after 24 hours","Go to admin.atlassian.com, which the allowlist doesn't restrict, and edit the allowlist"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。不在 allowlist 的人也不能透過 API 存取該 app，所以從被擋的位置呼叫 Jira API 一樣會失敗；而且 allowlist 是在 Atlassian Administration 管理，不在 Jira API。","B":"錯。IP allowlist 沒有自動到期的機制，啟用後會一直生效，直到 admin 修改或停用。","C":"對。官方寫明即使 IP 不在 allowlist 範圍內，仍可進入 admin.atlassian.com；所以 admin 可以直接回到 Security → Device security → IP allowlists 修正或停用。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/security-and-access-policies/docs/specify-ip-addresses-for-product-access/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.4.3-e18","sec":"520.4.3","dom":"520.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A regulator requires that the data of one specific Jira project be stored in Germany, while the rest of the site's projects can stay where they are. What can the admin do with data residency?","zh":"法規要求某一個 Jira project 的資料要存放在德國，同一個 site 的其他 project 可以不動。Admin 用 data residency 能做什麼？","zo":["無法只針對單一 project；data residency 以整個 app 設定","在該 project 的設定裡把它 pin 到德國","把該 project 的使用者 pin 到德國，讓他們的 work item 一起搬"],"fig":"","opts":["Nothing for a single project; data residency is configured for the whole app","Pin that project to Germany from the project's settings","Pin the project's users to Germany so their work items move with them"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。Data residency 以 app 為單位設定，不能只設個別 project、客戶或使用者；要符合這種要求，通常得把那個 project 放在另一個 app 執行個體（推論）。","B":"錯。Project 設定裡沒有 data residency 選項。位置是在 Atlassian Administration 的 Data management → Data residency，以整個 app 為對象。","C":"錯。使用者帳號資訊（姓名、email、頭像）本身就不在 data residency 範圍，也不能以使用者為單位 pin 資料。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/security-and-access-policies/docs/understand-data-residency/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.4.3-e19","sec":"520.4.3","dom":"520.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An admin schedules a data residency move for Jira on acme.atlassian.net. The same site URL also hosts Jira Service Management. How is Jira Service Management affected?","zh":"Admin 為 acme.atlassian.net 的 Jira 排定 data residency 搬移。同一個 site URL 也有 Jira Service Management。JSM 會受什麼影響？","zo":["照常運作，之後要另外排一次搬移","和 Jira 一起搬到新地區，搬移期間離線","留在原地區，因為只選了 Jira"],"fig":"","opts":["It keeps working normally and must be scheduled as a separate move later","It moves to the new location with Jira and is offline during the move","It stays in its current location, because only Jira was selected"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。需要另外申請的是 sandbox：搬 production 時 sandbox 不會跟著搬。同 site URL 的 JSM 則會一起搬，也一起停機。","B":"對。Jira 類 app 建在同一個平台上，所以同一個 site URL 的 Jira 與 JSM 會一起搬、一起離線、一起 pin 到新地區；停機最多約 24 小時。","C":"錯。不能只搬 Jira 而留下同 site URL 的 JSM；官方寫明搬其中一個就會一起搬其他 Jira 類 app。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/security-and-access-policies/docs/move-data-to-another-location/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.4.4-e20","sec":"520.4.4","dom":"520.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An org admin created an admin API key yesterday but didn't save its value. How can the admin get the key value now?","zh":"Org admin 昨天建立了一把 admin API key，但沒有保存它的值。現在要怎麼取得 key 的值？","zo":["請另一位 organization admin 在 audit log 查看","取不回來；撤銷這把 key 再建一把新的","打開 Organization settings > API keys 顯示 key"],"fig":"","opts":["Ask another organization admin to view it in the audit log","They can't; revoke the key and create a new one","Open Organization settings > API keys and reveal the key"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Audit log 記錄 admin 做了哪些動作，不會記錄 key 的值；其他 org admin 也看不到。","B":"對。API key 的值只在建立時顯示一次，Atlassian 為了安全不保存它，之後無法找回。遺失時應撤銷舊 key，再建一把新的並妥善保存。","C":"錯。API keys 頁能看到 key 的名稱、到期日並撤銷，但看不到 key 的值；官方明說 key 無法事後找回。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/manage-an-organization-with-the-admin-apis/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.4.4-e21","sec":"520.4.4","dom":"520.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. What is the most likely reason for the tunnel's status?","zh":"請看圖。這個 tunnel 狀態最可能的原因是什麼？","zo":["Data Center instance 不允許 port 443 的連入連線","還沒在 Confluence Cloud 建立 tunneled application link","Tunnel 的 security key 還沒加到 Data Center instance"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 179\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Application tunnels\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"177.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Atlassian Administration → Data sources</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Application tunnels</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Tunnels</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"100\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">confluence-dc.acme.internal</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Incomplete</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"129\" width=\"143.5\" height=\"26\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"83.75\" y=\"146\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\">Check connections</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"177.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["The Data Center instance doesn't allow incoming connections on port 443","No tunneled application link has been created in Confluence Cloud yet","The tunnel's security key hasn't been added to the Data Center instance yet"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Application tunnel 不需要任何連入的連線；Data Center 只要允許連出 port 443。沒設好 connector 與 upstream port 時，狀態會是 Misconfigured。","B":"錯。Tunneled application link 是 tunnel 建好之後才在 cloud app 建立的，tunnel 本身的狀態不取決於它。","C":"對。Cloud 端狀態 Incomplete 代表 tunnel 已在 admin.atlassian.com 建立，但它的 security key 還沒加到 Data Center；把 key 貼到 Data Center 後，狀態才會變成 Connected。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/troubleshoot-application-tunnels/","https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/configure-required-connections-and-upstream-ports/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.4.4-e22","sec":"520.4.4","dom":"520.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A company wants to link Jira Cloud with a Confluence Data Center instance that sits behind its firewall, without opening any inbound connections or allowlisting Atlassian IPs. What should the org admin set up?","zh":"公司想把 Jira Cloud 和防火牆內的 Confluence Data Center 連起來，不開放任何連入連線，也不把 Atlassian 的 IP 加進白名單。Org admin 應該設定什麼？","zo":["Application tunnel 與 tunneled application link","包含 Data Center IP 的 IP allowlist","讓 Confluence Data Center 呼叫 Jira Cloud 用的 admin API key"],"fig":"","opts":["An application tunnel and a tunneled application link","An IP allowlist that includes the Data Center instance's IP","An admin API key that Confluence Data Center uses to call Jira Cloud"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。Application tunnel 在 cloud organization 與內部網路的 Data Center 之間建立安全通道，讓 application link 不需要開放連入、也不用把 IP 加進白名單；再從 cloud 端建立 tunneled application link。","B":"錯。IP allowlist 限制誰能連進 Atlassian cloud app，方向剛好相反，也解決不了 cloud 連進防火牆內 Data Center 的問題。","C":"錯。Admin API key 用來呼叫 Atlassian Administration 的 admin API（管理 organization、使用者等），不是 app 之間整合用的連線方式。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/what-are-application-tunnels/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.4.4-e23","sec":"520.4.4","dom":"520.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A space admin wants Jira notifications for their space to come from support@acme.com, but the address isn't listed in the Notification email drop-down. What must happen first?","zh":"Space admin 希望他的 space 的 Jira 通知從 support@acme.com 寄出，但 Notification email 的下拉選單沒有這個地址。必須先做什麼？","zo":["Space admin 手動輸入地址，再從信箱確認","Org admin 在 Organization settings > Emails 加入 acme.com 網域並新增這個地址","Org admin 在 Directory > Domains 驗證 acme.com 並 claim 帳號"],"fig":"","opts":["The space admin must type the address manually and confirm it from the mailbox","An org admin must add acme.com as an email domain and add the address in Organization settings > Emails","An org admin must verify acme.com in Directory > Domains and claim its accounts"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Notification email 只能從清單選 custom email 或預設的 Jira 地址；清單內容必須由 org admin 在 admin.atlassian.com 先加好。","B":"對。Custom email 要由 org admin 在 Organization settings → Emails 加網域、把 DNS record 加到網域商、等網域 Active 後再加寄件地址並開放給這個 Jira；之後下拉才會出現它。","C":"錯。Directory → Domains 的網域驗證是為了 claim 帳號、管理 managed account；官方明說它和替通知加 email 網域是兩件事。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/what-are-the-steps-for-setting-up-custom-email-addresses/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-jira-cloud-to-send-emails-on-behalf-of-your-domain/","https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/add-email-addresses-for-your-domain/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"520.4.4-e24","sec":"520.4.4","dom":"520.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An organization admin who created several admin API keys is leaving the company. What does Atlassian recommend?","zh":"一位建立過多把 admin API key 的 organization admin 要離職了。Atlassian 建議怎麼做？","zo":["不用處理；拿掉他的 org admin 角色時 key 會自動撤銷","把 key 的擁有權轉給另一位 organization admin","撤銷這位 admin 建立的所有 API key"],"fig":"","opts":["Nothing; the keys are revoked when the admin's org admin role is removed","Transfer ownership of the keys to another organization admin","Revoke any API keys that the departing admin created"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。官方特別提醒要手動撤銷，表示 key 不會因為拿掉角色就自動失效；依賴自動撤銷會留下可用的 key。","B":"錯。Atlassian Administration 沒有轉移 API key 擁有者的功能；需要的話，由其他 org admin 建立新的 key。","C":"對。官方建議 org admin 離開 organization 時，撤銷他建立的所有 API key；撤銷是永久的，最多 10 分鐘後完全失效。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/organization-administration/docs/manage-an-organization-with-the-admin-apis/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":1}];